#: amir_mirror/1
msgctxt "Tag Nom d'objet (MAJUSCULES)"
msgid "MIRROR"
msgstr ""

#: amir_mirror/surface_level_intro/0/6
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "Your mirror has done its job dutifully over the years, accurately reflecting your image back at you in good times and bad. But today there is no reflection for you to scrutinize—only a long-haired beauty who looks at you like you're a work of art."
msgstr ""

#: amir_mirror/surface_level_intro/0/17
msgctxt "Amir"
msgid "Ah, Incredible!"
msgstr ""

#: amir_mirror/surface_level_intro/0/25/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Sorry, what are we talking about?"
msgstr ""

#: amir_mirror/surface_level_intro/0/26/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Who, me?"
msgstr ""

#: amir_mirror/surface_level_intro/0/27/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Oh! Yeah. Thanks."
msgstr ""

#: amir_mirror/surface_level_intro/0/g-0/0
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "Amir throws his arms out to stop you, gesturing to you to stay where you are."
msgstr ""

#: amir_mirror/surface_level_intro/0/g-0/8
msgctxt "Amir"
msgid "No, no, no, no, no! Don't move. Step back into the light."
msgstr ""

#: amir_mirror/surface_level_intro/0/g-0/16/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Like this?"
msgstr ""

#: amir_mirror/surface_level_intro/0/g-0/17/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Uh... I'm good here, thanks."
msgstr ""

#: amir_mirror/surface_level_intro/0/g-0/c-3/7 amir_mirror/surface_level_4/0/g-5/0 amir_mirror/surface_level6/0/g-6/c-14/7
msgctxt "Amir"
msgid "Yes!"
msgstr ""

#: amir_mirror/surface_level_intro/0/g-0/c-4/7
msgctxt "Amir"
msgid "Trust me, my darling, you'll see. See? Just a little to the left and... Ah!"
msgstr ""

#: amir_mirror/surface_level_intro/0/g-1/0
msgctxt "Amir"
msgid "Breathtaking. Look at you! Do you see how well I can frame your face from this angle? You are glowing!"
msgstr ""

#: amir_mirror/surface_level_intro/0/g-1/8/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I mean... it's still just me, though."
msgstr ""

#: amir_mirror/surface_level_intro/0/g-1/9/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I hate looking in the mirror."
msgstr ""

#: amir_mirror/surface_level_intro/0/g-1/10/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I totally see it! Thanks for noticing."
msgstr ""

#: amir_mirror/surface_level_intro/0/g-1/c-5/7
msgctxt "Amir"
msgid "When you are accustomed to the extraordinary, even the extraordinary appears mundane."
msgstr ""

#: amir_mirror/surface_level_intro/0/g-1/c-5/15/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I'm nothing special."
msgstr ""

#: amir_mirror/surface_level_intro/0/g-1/c-5/15/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Yeah. I guess you're right!"
msgstr ""

#: amir_mirror/surface_level_intro/0/g-1/c-5/15/c-0/7
msgctxt "Amir"
msgid "Ah nonsense! Nothing special? You're adorable!"
msgstr ""

#: amir_mirror/surface_level_intro/0/g-1/c-5/15/c-0/15
msgctxt "Amir"
msgid "How could you say such a thing. What could you possibly dislike about what you see?"
msgstr ""

#: amir_mirror/surface_level_intro/0/g-1/c-5/15/c-1/7
msgctxt "Amir"
msgid "That is fine. You can guess. But I will know, and I am happy to show you again any time you need."
msgstr ""

#: amir_mirror/surface_level_intro/0/g-1/c-5/15/c-1/15/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Are you for reals?"
msgstr ""

#: amir_mirror/surface_level_intro/0/g-1/c-5/15/c-1/15/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Coming on a little strong here..."
msgstr ""

#: amir_mirror/surface_level_intro/0/g-1/c-5/15/c-1/15/c-0/7
msgctxt "Amir"
msgid "Yes I am \"for reals\"!"
msgstr ""

#: amir_mirror/surface_level_intro/0/g-1/c-5/15/c-1/15/c-0/15
msgctxt "Amir"
msgid "I am standing right here in front of you."
msgstr ""

#: amir_mirror/surface_level_intro/0/g-1/c-5/15/c-1/15/c-0/23
msgctxt "Amir"
msgid "Are <i>you</i> \"for reals?\" You come to me with any doubt about what I see so clearly, your radiance?"
msgstr ""

#: amir_mirror/surface_level_intro/0/g-1/c-5/15/c-1/15/c-0/31
msgctxt "Amir"
msgid "It is possible you are not \"for reals.\""
msgstr ""

#: amir_mirror/surface_level_intro/0/g-1/c-5/15/c-1/15/c-0/39/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "No, I hear you. I just look... uhhh..."
msgstr ""

#: amir_mirror/surface_level_intro/0/g-1/c-5/15/c-1/15/c-0/39/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Maybe I have some doubts. It can be hard to keep the confidence up!"
msgstr ""

#: amir_mirror/surface_level_intro/0/g-1/c-5/15/c-1/15/c-0/39/c-0/7
msgctxt "Amir"
msgid "What? How do you look?"
msgstr ""

#: amir_mirror/surface_level_intro/0/g-1/c-5/15/c-1/15/c-0/39/c-1/7
msgctxt "Amir"
msgid "I understand that. It can be difficult! But for you..."
msgstr ""

#: amir_mirror/surface_level_intro/0/g-1/c-5/15/c-1/15/c-0/39/c-1/15
msgctxt "Amir"
msgid "...tell me, what do you see that I do not see, that makes this doubt recur for you?"
msgstr ""

#: amir_mirror/surface_level_intro/0/g-1/c-5/15/c-1/15/c-1/7
msgctxt "Amir"
msgid "If I am strong, it is because I am strongly inspired. I reflect what I perceive!"
msgstr ""

#: amir_mirror/surface_level_intro/0/g-1/c-5/15/c-1/15/c-1/15/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I just find that hard to believe."
msgstr ""

#: amir_mirror/surface_level_intro/0/g-1/c-5/15/c-1/15/c-1/15/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Are we looking at the same person right now?"
msgstr ""

#: amir_mirror/surface_level_intro/0/g-1/c-5/15/c-1/15/c-1/15/c-0/7
msgctxt "Amir"
msgid "Ah, this reluctance to accept the adoration!"
msgstr ""

#: amir_mirror/surface_level_intro/0/g-1/c-5/15/c-1/15/c-1/15/c-0/15 amir_mirror/surface_level_intro/0/g-1/c-5/15/c-1/15/c-1/15/c-1/31
msgctxt "Amir"
msgid "Tell me, what is there to dislike about what you see?"
msgstr ""

#: amir_mirror/surface_level_intro/0/g-1/c-5/15/c-1/15/c-1/15/c-1/7
msgctxt "Amir"
msgid "Yes, yes I was just wondering the same thing."
msgstr ""

#: amir_mirror/surface_level_intro/0/g-1/c-5/15/c-1/15/c-1/15/c-1/15
msgctxt "Amir"
msgid "Because the person I see in my reflection right now has beauty beyond question."
msgstr ""

#: amir_mirror/surface_level_intro/0/g-1/c-5/15/c-1/15/c-1/15/c-1/23
msgctxt "Amir"
msgid "And yet, here you stand with your questions!"
msgstr ""

#: amir_mirror/surface_level_intro/0/g-1/c-6/7
msgctxt "Amir"
msgid "My darling. No! This is such nonsense! Why would you say this? What could you possibly dislike about what you see?"
msgstr ""

#: amir_mirror/surface_level_intro/0/g-1/c-7/13
msgctxt "Amir"
msgid "But I could not help noticing! You are radiant. I simply reflect the beauty in front of me."
msgstr ""

#: amir_mirror/surface_level_intro/0/g-1/c-7/24/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Thanks. I really love hearing that."
msgstr ""

#: amir_mirror/surface_level_intro/0/g-1/c-7/24/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I'm not sure what else to say now..."
msgstr ""

#: amir_mirror/surface_level_intro/0/g-1/c-7/24/c-1/7
msgctxt "Amir"
msgid "Oh, no need to worry. I still have much to express to you!"
msgstr ""

#: amir_mirror/surface_level_intro/0/g-2/0
msgctxt "Amir"
msgid "I can see in you... your beauty must be something you are already familiar with."
msgstr ""

#: amir_mirror/surface_level_intro/0/g-2/9/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Oh sure, people always tell me I could model."
msgstr ""

#: amir_mirror/surface_level_intro/0/g-2/c-8/21/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Yeah, no."
msgstr ""

#: amir_mirror/surface_level_intro/0/g-2/c-8/21/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I don't know!"
msgstr ""

#: amir_mirror/surface_level_intro/0/g-2/c-8/21/g-0/0
msgctxt "Amir"
msgid "I cannot believe this! How could you possibly not see your own natural radiance?"
msgstr ""

#: amir_mirror/surface_level_intro/0/g-2/c-8/21/g-0/8
msgctxt "Amir"
msgid "What <i>do</i> you see?"
msgstr ""

#: amir_mirror/surface_level_intro/0/g-2/c-9/7
msgctxt "Amir"
msgid "Yes, I can see this for you!"
msgstr ""

#: amir_mirror/surface_level_intro/0/g-2/c-9/15/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Maybe... we'll see!"
msgstr ""

#: amir_mirror/surface_level_intro/0/g-2/c-9/15/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I was being sarcastic."
msgstr ""

#: amir_mirror/surface_level_intro/0/g-2/c-9/15/2/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Wait, you really think so? I was making a joke..."
msgstr ""

#: amir_mirror/surface_level_intro/0/g-2/c-9/15/3/s/0 amir_mirror/surface_level_intro/0/insecurity_exit/c-13/15/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "You're right, I look amazing!"
msgstr ""

#: amir_mirror/surface_level_intro/0/g-2/c-9/15/c-0/7
msgctxt "Amir"
msgid "Oh my goodness... that boost of confidence... I can actually see it spreading over your face like the most invigorating flush!"
msgstr ""

#: amir_mirror/surface_level_intro/0/g-2/c-9/15/c-1/7
msgctxt "Amir"
msgid "Sarcasm is a guise for self loathing, azizam. I hardly think that is fitting for you, don't you agree?"
msgstr ""

#: amir_mirror/surface_level_intro/0/g-2/c-9/15/c-1/15/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Ouch. Self-loathing? That was harsh."
msgstr ""

#: amir_mirror/surface_level_intro/0/g-2/c-9/15/c-1/15/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I... I do agree. Maybe sarcasm isn't my best look."
msgstr ""

#: amir_mirror/surface_level_intro/0/g-2/c-9/15/c-1/15/c-0/7
msgctxt "Amir"
msgid "Sometimes the truth can feel harsh! But please believe me... it comes only from love."
msgstr ""

#: amir_mirror/surface_level_intro/0/g-2/c-9/15/c-1/15/c-0/15
msgctxt "Amir"
msgid "I want to clear the terrible fog away from your eyes so you can see yourself clearly."
msgstr ""

#: amir_mirror/surface_level_intro/0/g-2/c-9/15/c-1/15/c-0/23/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "You're saying I don't see myself accurately?"
msgstr ""

#: amir_mirror/surface_level_intro/0/g-2/c-9/15/c-1/15/c-0/23/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Like when I have to wipe the fog off of you after a shower?"
msgstr ""

#: amir_mirror/surface_level_intro/0/g-2/c-9/15/c-1/15/g-0/0
msgctxt "Amir"
msgid "Exactly, joonam. Nothing but heavy fog there."
msgstr ""

#: amir_mirror/surface_level_intro/0/g-2/c-9/15/c-1/15/g-0/8
msgctxt "Amir"
msgid "Now, be truthful. What do you see when you look at yourself? It's safe to be honest."
msgstr ""

#: amir_mirror/surface_level_intro/0/g-2/c-9/15/c-2/7
msgctxt "Amir"
msgid "Absolutely! And jokes are good, but remember this is an honest compliment."
msgstr ""

#: amir_mirror/surface_level_intro/0/g-2/c-9/15/c-2/15
msgctxt "Amir"
msgid "You know, I believe Betty knows a little something about this area."
msgstr ""

#: amir_mirror/surface_level_intro/0/g-2/c-9/15/c-2/23
msgctxt "Amir"
msgid "Perhaps you should discuss it with her. You might find it's something you quite enjoy!"
msgstr ""

#: amir_mirror/surface_level_intro/0/g-2/c-9/15/c-2/31
msgctxt "Amir"
msgid "I'll be here when you get back."
msgstr ""

#: amir_mirror/surface_level_intro/0/g-2/c-9/15/c-3/13
msgctxt "Amir"
msgid "Bah bah, there's that incredible glow. Confidence looks good on you."
msgstr ""

#: amir_mirror/surface_level_intro/0/g-2/c-9/15/c-3/24
msgctxt "Amir"
msgid "Feel free to stop by any time so I can admire it some more..."
msgstr ""

#: amir_mirror/surface_level_intro/0/insecurity_choices/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I look old."
msgstr ""

#: amir_mirror/surface_level_intro/0/insecurity_choices/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I look tired."
msgstr ""

#: amir_mirror/surface_level_intro/0/insecurity_choices/2/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I look like I got dressed in the dark... which I did."
msgstr ""

#: amir_mirror/surface_level_intro/0/insecurity_choices/c-10/7
msgctxt "Amir"
msgid "But like a fine wine, we age. And our natural beauty only enhances with time."
msgstr ""

#: amir_mirror/surface_level_intro/0/insecurity_choices/c-10/15
msgctxt "Amir"
msgid "We radiate with the wisdom of our experiences."
msgstr ""

#: amir_mirror/surface_level_intro/0/insecurity_choices/c-11/7
msgctxt "Amir"
msgid "The sign of a busy mind! That fatigue you see speaks to your many accomplishments!"
msgstr ""

#: amir_mirror/surface_level_intro/0/insecurity_choices/c-11/15
msgctxt "Amir"
msgid "Still, rest is vital for your health. Best to make some time for that, don't you think?"
msgstr ""

#: amir_mirror/surface_level_intro/0/insecurity_choices/c-12/7
msgctxt "Amir"
msgid "Nonsense! You look-"
msgstr ""

#: amir_mirror/surface_level_intro/0/insecurity_choices/c-12/15
msgctxt "Amir"
msgid "Ah... hmm."
msgstr ""

#: amir_mirror/surface_level_intro/0/insecurity_choices/c-12/26
msgctxt "Amir"
msgid "You know, dear, the dress is maybe not so flattering for you. But that is such an easy thing to change! Easy and fun, when you are ready."
msgstr ""

#: amir_mirror/surface_level_intro/0/insecurity_choices/c-12/34
msgctxt "Amir"
msgid "And even your lack of finery cannot dampen your natural allure!"
msgstr ""

#: amir_mirror/surface_level_intro/0/insecurity_exit/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Huh, well when you put it like that..."
msgstr ""

#: amir_mirror/surface_level_intro/0/insecurity_exit/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "You are a flatterer, Amir."
msgstr ""

#: amir_mirror/surface_level_intro/0/insecurity_exit/c-13/7
msgctxt "Amir"
msgid "Now you see what I see."
msgstr ""

#: amir_mirror/surface_level_intro/0/insecurity_exit/c-13/15/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I guess? I'm not sold yet, but I appreciate it anyway."
msgstr ""

#: amir_mirror/surface_level_intro/0/insecurity_exit/c-13/15/2/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "...not even a little bit."
msgstr ""

#: amir_mirror/surface_level_intro/0/insecurity_exit/c-13/15/c-0/13
msgctxt "Amir"
msgid "Ah, there's that incredible glow again. Confidence looks good on you."
msgstr ""

#: amir_mirror/surface_level_intro/0/insecurity_exit/c-13/15/c-0/24
msgctxt "Amir"
msgid "Feel free to stop by any time so I can admire it some more~"
msgstr ""

#: amir_mirror/surface_level_intro/0/insecurity_exit/c-13/15/c-1/7
msgctxt "Amir"
msgid "Ah but the spark has been lit! You'll see. We will just have to fan those flames until they're a big, beautiful rolling flame, won't we?"
msgstr ""

#: amir_mirror/surface_level_intro/0/insecurity_exit/c-13/15/c-1/15 amir_mirror/surface_level_intro/0/insecurity_exit/c-13/15/c-2/15
msgctxt "Amir"
msgid "Stop by any time, I'm happy to admire your beauty any day~"
msgstr ""

#: amir_mirror/surface_level_intro/0/insecurity_exit/c-13/15/c-2/7
msgctxt "Amir"
msgid "Well, we will just have to continue your lessons until you do then, won't we?"
msgstr ""

#: amir_mirror/surface_level_intro/0/insecurity_exit/c-14/7
msgctxt "Amir"
msgid "Ah... but the spark has been lit! You'll see. We will just have to fan those flames until they're a great big, beautiful rolling flame, won't we?"
msgstr ""

#: amir_mirror/surface_level_intro/0/insecurity_exit/c-14/15
msgctxt "Amir"
msgid "Stop by any time, I'm happy to admire your beauty any day..."
msgstr ""

#: amir_mirror/surface_level_2/0/6
msgctxt "Amir"
msgid "Ah, my dear, you have come back to visit and give me the chance to admire your..."
msgstr ""

#: amir_mirror/surface_level_2/0/14
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "Amir's smile falters, his effusive praise coming to a grinding halt."
msgstr ""

#: amir_mirror/surface_level_2/0/22
msgctxt "Amir"
msgid "Oh oh oh my- tragedy mars your beauty."
msgstr ""

#: amir_mirror/surface_level_2/0/30
msgctxt "Amir"
msgid "It is nothing to do with your gorgeous proportions... your stunning features."
msgstr ""

#: amir_mirror/surface_level_2/0/38
msgctxt "Amir"
msgid "It is... green."
msgstr ""

#: amir_mirror/surface_level_2/0/46
msgctxt "Amir"
msgid "A color that cannot belong in the white statuary of your teeth."
msgstr ""

#: amir_mirror/surface_level_2/0/54
msgctxt "Amir"
msgid "Did you have... broccoli recently?"
msgstr ""

#: amir_mirror/surface_level_2/0/62/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Yeah, for breakfast."
msgstr ""

#: amir_mirror/surface_level_2/0/63/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "No... not for a while."
msgstr ""

#: amir_mirror/surface_level_2/0/64/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I pretty much avoid anything green."
msgstr ""

#: amir_mirror/surface_level_2/0/c-0/7
msgctxt "Amir"
msgid "Ah, that's a strange choice..."
msgstr ""

#: amir_mirror/surface_level_2/0/c-0/18
msgctxt "Amir"
msgid "Well, I'm afraid you have some left over in your teeth, just... there. Take a look."
msgstr ""

#: amir_mirror/surface_level_2/0/c-1/7
msgctxt "Amir"
msgid "Well, I'm afraid you have something green in your teeth, just... there. Take a look."
msgstr ""

#: amir_mirror/surface_level_2/0/c-2/7
msgctxt "Amir"
msgid "Nonetheless something most green or vegetal is in your teeth, just... there. Take a look."
msgstr ""

#: amir_mirror/surface_level_2/0/g-0/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "How long has that been there?!"
msgstr ""

#: amir_mirror/surface_level_2/0/g-0/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "It's a good thing I don't ever have any guests..."
msgstr ""

#: amir_mirror/surface_level_2/0/g-0/2/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Wait, when <i>was</i> the last time I had a vegetable?"
msgstr ""

#: amir_mirror/surface_level_2/0/g-0/c-3/7
msgctxt "Amir"
msgid "I'm sure not long... One can hope."
msgstr ""

#: amir_mirror/surface_level_2/0/g-0/c-4/7
msgctxt "Amir"
msgid "Yes, indeed! You know, I think it might be best to uh <i>check in</i> with me before any of those encounters in the future. And..."
msgstr ""

#: amir_mirror/surface_level_2/0/g-0/c-5/7
msgctxt "Amir"
msgid "Oh now that is a good question."
msgstr ""

#: amir_mirror/surface_level_2/0/g-0/c-5/15
msgctxt "Amir"
msgid "For so, so... so many reasons that is an important question to ask."
msgstr ""

#: amir_mirror/surface_level_2/0/g-0/c-5/23
msgctxt "Amir"
msgid "You know, as some advice that's coming from love..."
msgstr ""

#: amir_mirror/surface_level_2/0/g-1/0
msgctxt "Amir"
msgid "Perhaps you should consider flossing more often. I'm sure Barry would be happy to lend you a hand with it, actually."
msgstr ""

#: amir_mirror/surface_level_2/0/g-1/11
msgctxt "Amir"
msgid "He's rather obnoxiously reliable with personal routine."
msgstr ""

#: amir_mirror/surface_level_2/0/g-1/19
msgctxt "Amir"
msgid "Hmm."
msgstr ""

#: amir_mirror/surface_level_2/0/g-1/27/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "It's unsettling when you stare like that..."
msgstr ""

#: amir_mirror/surface_level_2/0/g-1/28/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Oh, you mean I should go right now?"
msgstr ""

#: amir_mirror/surface_level_2/0/g-1/c-6/7
msgctxt "Amir"
msgid "Oh, I'm so sorry... I am always one to fixate on hygiene..."
msgstr ""

#: amir_mirror/surface_level_2/0/g-1/c-6/18
msgctxt "Amir"
msgid "And, coincidentally, I seem to recall Barry saying he had some free time today..."
msgstr ""

#: amir_mirror/surface_level_2/0/g-1/c-6/26/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Ok ok, I can take a hint."
msgstr ""

#: amir_mirror/surface_level_2/0/g-1/c-6/26/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "What if I'd rather stay here with you?"
msgstr ""

#: amir_mirror/surface_level_2/0/g-1/c-6/26/c-0/7
msgctxt "Amir"
msgid "Oh good! I did not want to have to tell you how disgusting it was."
msgstr ""

#: amir_mirror/surface_level_2/0/g-1/c-6/26/c-0/18
msgctxt "Amir"
msgid "YOU are not disgusting, the... the <i>thing</i> was, and it can happen to the best of us."
msgstr ""

#: amir_mirror/surface_level_2/0/g-1/c-6/26/c-0/26
msgctxt "Amir"
msgid "I'm glad I don't have to tell you how looking at it was causing me to feel nauseated."
msgstr ""

#: amir_mirror/surface_level_2/0/g-1/c-6/26/c-0/34
msgctxt "Amir"
msgid "Or how that... old... shade of green really doesn't suit you."
msgstr ""

#: amir_mirror/surface_level_2/0/g-1/c-6/26/c-0/42
msgctxt "Amir"
msgid "That would have been rude. And I-I <i>so</i> hate to be rude!"
msgstr ""

#: amir_mirror/surface_level_2/0/g-1/c-6/26/c-0/50/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Wow. Yeah. SO glad you didn't have to say all that."
msgstr ""

#: amir_mirror/surface_level_2/0/g-1/c-6/26/c-0/50/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Um, that was rude. And a little hurtful."
msgstr ""

#: amir_mirror/surface_level_2/0/g-1/c-6/26/c-0/50/g-0/0
msgctxt "Amir"
msgid "Exactly, so nice to be on the same page."
msgstr ""

#: amir_mirror/surface_level_2/0/g-1/c-6/26/c-0/50/g-0/8
msgctxt "Amir"
msgid "Do come back once you've taken care of yourself!"
msgstr ""

#: amir_mirror/surface_level_2/0/g-1/c-6/26/c-1/7
msgctxt "Amir"
msgid "That would be wonderful! I do feel that I am not seeing your best self. I think, I'd be delighted to have you..."
msgstr ""

#: amir_mirror/surface_level_2/0/g-1/c-6/26/c-1/15
msgctxt "Amir"
msgid "...after you see Barry."
msgstr ""

#: amir_mirror/surface_level_2/0/g-1/c-7/13
msgctxt "Amir"
msgid "Mmm. Yes, I think that would be best."
msgstr ""

#: amir_mirror/surface_level_2/0/g-1/c-7/21
msgctxt "Amir"
msgid "Your beauty is too luminous to deprive the world of it for one second more."
msgstr ""

#: amir_mirror/surface_level_3/0/6
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "Amir's gaze lingers on your teeth for just a little too long before he smiles at you, spreading his arms wide in a grand and theatrical way."
msgstr ""

#: amir_mirror/surface_level_3/0/14
msgctxt "Amir"
msgid "Ah, the Broccoli Situation has been resolved."
msgstr ""

#: amir_mirror/surface_level_3/0/22
msgctxt "Amir"
msgid "Peace reigns among the bathroom."
msgstr ""

#: amir_mirror/surface_level_3/0/30
msgctxt "Amir"
msgid "Now we can get to the real reason why you have returned."
msgstr ""

#: amir_mirror/surface_level_3/0/38/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I don't know that reason... I don't think?"
msgstr ""

#: amir_mirror/surface_level_3/0/39/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "All right, shoot."
msgstr ""

#: amir_mirror/surface_level_3/0/c-0/7
msgctxt "Amir"
msgid "You do not need to, it is obvious. It is written all over your face."
msgstr ""

#: amir_mirror/surface_level_3/0/c-0/15
msgctxt "Amir"
msgid "You forget, I am something of an expert in your face."
msgstr ""

#: amir_mirror/surface_level_3/0/g-0/0
msgctxt "Amir"
msgid "You are wanting my opinion on your outfit?"
msgstr ""

#: amir_mirror/surface_level_3/0/g-0/8/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "How did you know?!"
msgstr ""

#: amir_mirror/surface_level_3/0/g-0/9/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I guess... if you want to?"
msgstr ""

#: amir_mirror/surface_level_3/0/g-0/c-2/7
msgctxt "Amir"
msgid "Yes, yes I am very impressive and you may tell me so later."
msgstr ""

#: amir_mirror/surface_level_3/0/g-0/c-2/15
msgctxt "Amir"
msgid "But at this moment we have so very much to do! Show me what we are working with!"
msgstr ""

#: amir_mirror/surface_level_3/0/g-0/c-3/7
msgctxt "Amir"
msgid "Hmm"
msgstr ""

#: amir_mirror/surface_level_3/0/g-0/c-3/15
msgctxt "Amir"
msgid "Zood bosh, hesitation is a bad shade!"
msgstr ""

#: amir_mirror/surface_level_3/0/g-1/0
msgctxt "Amir"
msgid "Ahh let's see a turn."
msgstr ""

#: amir_mirror/surface_level_3/0/g-1/8/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Oh right, sorry."
msgstr ""

#: amir_mirror/surface_level_3/0/g-1/9/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I don't do well under pressure."
msgstr ""

#: amir_mirror/surface_level_3/0/g-1/c-5/7
msgctxt "Amir"
msgid "I said turn!"
msgstr ""

#: amir_mirror/surface_level_3/0/g-1/c-5/18/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Damn. Taskmaster. Ok ok, turning."
msgstr ""

#: amir_mirror/surface_level_3/0/g-1/c-5/18/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Look at all the angles, please!"
msgstr ""

#: amir_mirror/surface_level_3/0/g-2/0
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "Amir inspects you from every angle, turning his head this way and that as he evaluates you."
msgstr ""

#: amir_mirror/surface_level_3/0/g-2/8
msgctxt "Amir"
msgid "Hmmmm..."
msgstr ""

#: amir_mirror/surface_level_3/0/g-2/16
msgctxt "Amir"
msgid "Well, the good news is that I don't think it is a complete failure."
msgstr ""

#: amir_mirror/surface_level_3/0/g-2/24
msgctxt "Amir"
msgid "Perhaps, with a few tweaks..."
msgstr ""

#: amir_mirror/surface_level_3/0/g-2/32
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "Amir comes closer, his arms out and his hands grasping for you."
msgstr ""

#: amir_mirror/surface_level_3/0/g-2/40
msgctxt "Amir"
msgid "Allow me to... adjust..."
msgstr ""

#: amir_mirror/surface_level_3/0/g-2/48
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "His hands are everywhere, though his touch is nothing but respectful. He makes all manner of small changes, pulling and pushing wherever he sees fit."
msgstr ""

#: amir_mirror/surface_level_3/0/g-2/53/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "What are you doing?"
msgstr ""

#: amir_mirror/surface_level_3/0/g-2/54/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Oh... that feels... really nice."
msgstr ""

#: amir_mirror/surface_level_3/0/g-2/c-6/7
msgctxt "Amir"
msgid "Adjusting... nothing more."
msgstr ""

#: amir_mirror/surface_level_3/0/g-2/c-6/15
msgctxt "Amir"
msgid "Unless..."
msgstr ""

#: amir_mirror/surface_level_3/0/g-2/c-6/23
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "There's a hint of promise in that 'unless'..."
msgstr ""

#: amir_mirror/surface_level_3/0/g-2/c-6/28/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Nope, nothing more."
msgstr ""

#: amir_mirror/surface_level_3/0/g-2/c-6/28/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Please..."
msgstr ""

#: amir_mirror/surface_level_3/0/g-2/c-6/28/c-0/7
msgctxt "Amir"
msgid "Of course."
msgstr ""

#: amir_mirror/surface_level_3/0/g-2/c-6/28/c-1/7
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "Amir's touch takes on a sensual quality, bringing it closer to a massage than an adjustment of your look."
msgstr ""

#: amir_mirror/surface_level_3/0/g-2/c-6/28/c-1/12
msgctxt "Amir"
msgid "Hmm... what an honor to touch you like this."
msgstr ""

#: amir_mirror/surface_level_3/0/g-2/c-6/28/c-1/20
msgctxt "Amir"
msgid "It brings delight to my glass."
msgstr ""

#: amir_mirror/surface_level_3/0/g-2/c-7/7
msgctxt "Amir"
msgid "It might not surprise you to let you know I am a masseuse as well as an arbiter of taste."
msgstr ""

#: amir_mirror/surface_level_3/0/g-3/0
msgctxt "Amir"
msgid "I am almost finished."
msgstr ""

#: amir_mirror/surface_level_3/0/g-3/11
msgctxt "Amir"
msgid "Just a teensy... bit... more..."
msgstr ""

#: amir_mirror/surface_level_3/0/g-3/19
msgctxt "Amir"
msgid "There!"
msgstr ""

#: amir_mirror/surface_level_3/0/g-3/27
msgctxt "Amir"
msgid "Now come, look! What do you think?"
msgstr ""

#: amir_mirror/surface_level_3/0/g-3/35/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I... look exactly the same."
msgstr ""

#: amir_mirror/surface_level_3/0/g-3/c-8/7 amir_mirror/self_reflection/0/g-1/c-5/15/g-0/0
msgctxt "Amir"
msgid "WHAT?!"
msgstr ""

#: amir_mirror/surface_level_3/0/g-3/c-8/15
msgctxt "Amir"
msgid "Absurd!"
msgstr ""

#: amir_mirror/surface_level_3/0/g-3/c-8/23
msgctxt "Amir"
msgid "How can you <i>possibly</i> not see the distinction between what I have conjured and that almost careless display you walked in wearing?!"
msgstr ""

#: amir_mirror/surface_level_3/0/g-3/c-8/31
msgctxt "Amir"
msgid "Ah, I am getting carried away. Of course it was not so bad... but I must have a moment to collect myself."
msgstr ""

#: amir_mirror/surface_level_3/0/g-3/c-8/39
msgctxt "Amir"
msgid "Artists are delicate, okay? I cannot talk right now. Leave me!"
msgstr ""

#: amir_mirror/surface_level_3/0/g-3/c-8/47/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I wasn't trying to insult you!"
msgstr ""

#: amir_mirror/surface_level_3/0/g-3/c-8/47/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I'm... yeah. So confused."
msgstr ""

#: amir_mirror/surface_level_3/0/g-4/0
msgctxt "Amir"
msgid "Ah, please! I said go. Out. Bodo!"
msgstr ""

#: amir_mirror/surface_level_3/0/g-4/12/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Oh. Wow. I look fantastic!"
msgstr ""

#: amir_mirror/surface_level_3/0/g-4/c-9/13
msgctxt "Amir"
msgid "Ah see!"
msgstr ""

#: amir_mirror/surface_level_3/0/g-4/c-9/21
msgctxt "Amir"
msgid "This is why you should never doubt me."
msgstr ""

#: amir_mirror/surface_level_3/0/g-4/c-9/29
msgctxt "Amir"
msgid "And remember, my artistry is only to highlight your natural beauty! Which is now fully on display."
msgstr ""

#: amir_mirror/surface_level_3/0/g-4/c-9/37
msgctxt "Amir"
msgid "That is thanks enough for me. Assuming you were preparing to thank me profusely."
msgstr ""

#: amir_mirror/surface_level_3/0/g-4/c-9/45
msgctxt "Amir"
msgid "Go now, my love. An artist needs their rest."
msgstr ""

#: amir_mirror/surface_level_4/0/6
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "Amir for once doesn't lavish you with compliments when he sees you approach—he simply sighs, his expression as heavy as his mood."
msgstr ""

#: amir_mirror/surface_level_4/0/22/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Big sigh... what's wrong?"
msgstr ""

#: amir_mirror/surface_level_4/0/23/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Are you ok?"
msgstr ""

#: amir_mirror/surface_level_4/0/c-0/7
msgctxt "Amir"
msgid "Nothing..."
msgstr ""

#: amir_mirror/surface_level_4/0/c-1/7
msgctxt "Amir"
msgid "Yes, yes. I am fine. It is nothing..."
msgstr ""

#: amir_mirror/surface_level_4/0/g-0/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "It doesn't sound like nothing."
msgstr ""

#: amir_mirror/surface_level_4/0/g-0/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Well, if you're good, I can go..."
msgstr ""

#: amir_mirror/surface_level_4/0/g-0/c-3/7
msgctxt "Amir"
msgid "Waaaaait!"
msgstr ""

#: amir_mirror/surface_level_4/0/g-1/0
msgctxt "Amir"
msgid "Alright. You have caught me. It is not nothing."
msgstr ""

#: amir_mirror/surface_level_4/0/g-1/8
msgctxt "Amir"
msgid "Very clever azizam."
msgstr ""

#: amir_mirror/surface_level_4/0/g-1/16
msgctxt "Amir"
msgid "I am afraid I am not in the best of spirits."
msgstr ""

#: amir_mirror/surface_level_4/0/g-1/24/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Seems like you're baiting me."
msgstr ""

#: amir_mirror/surface_level_4/0/g-1/25/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I'm all ears."
msgstr ""

#: amir_mirror/surface_level_4/0/g-1/26/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "What can I do to cheer you up?"
msgstr ""

#: amir_mirror/surface_level_4/0/g-1/c-4/7
msgctxt "Amir"
msgid "Baiting? Whatever for?"
msgstr ""

#: amir_mirror/surface_level_4/0/g-1/c-4/15/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Into giving you attention."
msgstr ""

#: amir_mirror/surface_level_4/0/g-1/c-4/15/c-0/7
msgctxt "Amir"
msgid "Is that so wrong?"
msgstr ""

#: amir_mirror/surface_level_4/0/g-1/c-4/15/c-0/15/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "It's a little annoying."
msgstr ""

#: amir_mirror/surface_level_4/0/g-1/c-4/15/c-0/15/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I guess I do like looking at you..."
msgstr ""

#: amir_mirror/surface_level_4/0/g-1/c-4/15/c-0/15/c-0/7
msgctxt "Amir"
msgid "I will stop. Here I am. Stopping."
msgstr ""

#: amir_mirror/surface_level_4/0/g-1/c-4/15/c-0/15/c-0/15
msgctxt "Amir"
msgid "See? All is well."
msgstr ""

#: amir_mirror/surface_level_4/0/g-1/c-4/15/c-0/15/c-0/23
msgctxt "Amir"
msgid "You... you are excellent at fixing that which is broken."
msgstr ""

#: amir_mirror/surface_level_4/0/g-1/c-4/15/c-0/15/c-0/34
msgctxt "Amir"
msgid "Until next time."
msgstr ""

#: amir_mirror/surface_level_4/0/g-1/c-4/15/c-0/15/c-1/7
msgctxt "Amir"
msgid "I thought so."
msgstr ""

#: amir_mirror/surface_level_4/0/g-1/c-4/15/c-0/15/c-1/15
msgctxt "Amir"
msgid "Still..."
msgstr ""

#: amir_mirror/surface_level_4/0/g-2/8
msgctxt "Amir"
msgid "I do not know."
msgstr ""

#: amir_mirror/surface_level_4/0/g-2/16
msgctxt "Amir"
msgid "It is just..."
msgstr ""

#: amir_mirror/surface_level_4/0/g-2/24
msgctxt "Amir"
msgid "Things have been so slow around the house today."
msgstr ""

#: amir_mirror/surface_level_4/0/g-2/32
msgctxt "Amir"
msgid "Everyone is off being too busy with their little jobs and their little hobbies, completely abandoning me."
msgstr ""

#: amir_mirror/surface_level_4/0/g-2/40
msgctxt "Amir"
msgid "It is very selfish!"
msgstr ""

#: amir_mirror/surface_level_4/0/g-2/48/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I'm confused. So you're just bored?"
msgstr ""

#: amir_mirror/surface_level_4/0/g-2/48/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Oh, that's actually really tough, I'm sorry."
msgstr ""

#: amir_mirror/surface_level_4/0/g-2/48/c-7/7
msgctxt "Amir"
msgid "No, I am not <i>just</i> bored!"
msgstr ""

#: amir_mirror/surface_level_4/0/g-2/48/c-7/15
msgctxt "Amir"
msgid "I am <i>desperately</i> bored. It is sad reflecting on my own."
msgstr ""

#: amir_mirror/surface_level_4/0/g-2/48/c-7/23
msgctxt "Amir"
msgid "I... I'm lonely."
msgstr ""

#: amir_mirror/surface_level_4/0/g-2/48/c-8/7
msgctxt "Amir"
msgid "Yes, exactly!"
msgstr ""

#: amir_mirror/surface_level_4/0/g-2/48/c-8/15
msgctxt "Amir"
msgid "You understand what horrible pain I am in."
msgstr ""

#: amir_mirror/surface_level_4/0/g-2/48/c-8/23
msgctxt "Amir"
msgid "Ah, thank you. It is nice to be understood."
msgstr ""

#: amir_mirror/surface_level_4/0/g-2/48/c-8/31
msgctxt "Amir"
msgid "It eases the sting, a bit."
msgstr ""

#: amir_mirror/surface_level_4/0/g-4/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "What if I kept you company for a bit?"
msgstr ""

#: amir_mirror/surface_level_4/0/g-4/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "How about I hang out for a while then?"
msgstr ""

#: amir_mirror/surface_level_4/0/g-5/8
msgctxt "Amir"
msgid "Yes, I would like that very much."
msgstr ""

#: amir_mirror/surface_level_4/0/g-5/16/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Great, what should we do?"
msgstr ""

#: amir_mirror/surface_level_4/0/g-5/17/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Got anything in mind?"
msgstr ""

#: amir_mirror/surface_level_4/0/g-6/0
msgctxt "Amir"
msgid "Well..."
msgstr ""

#: amir_mirror/surface_level_4/0/g-6/8
msgctxt "Amir"
msgid "Other than gazing at each other..."
msgstr ""

#: amir_mirror/surface_level_4/0/g-6/24 amir_mirror/surface_level5/0/g-2/c-6/18
msgctxt "Amir"
msgid "Oh!"
msgstr ""

#: amir_mirror/surface_level_4/0/g-6/32
msgctxt "Amir"
msgid "Ooh, let us read from my favorite Lewis Barrel novel \"You the Looking Glass\"..."
msgstr ""

#: amir_mirror/surface_level_4/0/g-6/43
msgctxt "Amir"
msgid "It deals with the young Alice's adventures as she stares directly at a mirror for hundreds of chapters."
msgstr ""

#: amir_mirror/surface_level_4/0/g-6/51/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Sounds good."
msgstr ""

#: amir_mirror/surface_level_4/0/g-6/52/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Oof. Not really a favorite of mine."
msgstr ""

#: amir_mirror/surface_level_4/0/g-6/c-13/10
msgctxt "Amir"
msgid "Well then. Let us settle in for some companionable reading!"
msgstr ""

#: amir_mirror/surface_level_4/0/g-6/c-13/18 amir_mirror/surface_level_4/0/g-7/11
msgctxt "Amir"
msgid "Thank you for cheering me up, azizam."
msgstr ""

#: amir_mirror/surface_level_4/0/g-6/c-14/10
msgctxt "Amir"
msgid "Well that's all right. How about we come up with our own version of the story with our own original characters! We can make it like a game!"
msgstr ""

#: amir_mirror/surface_level_4/0/g-6/c-14/18
msgctxt "Amir"
msgid "...and they can have consensual relations with each other perhaps..."
msgstr ""

#: amir_mirror/surface_level_4/0/g-6/c-14/26/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Now you're talking..."
msgstr ""

#: amir_mirror/surface_level_4/0/g-6/c-14/26/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "That escalated quickly."
msgstr ""

#: amir_mirror/surface_level_4/0/g-6/c-14/26/c-0/7
msgctxt "Amir"
msgid "...thank you, azizam, for making this mirror feel less lonely."
msgstr ""

#: amir_mirror/surface_level_4/0/g-7/0
msgctxt "Amir"
msgid "Yes yes yes. But I digress."
msgstr ""

#: amir_mirror/surface_level5/0/6
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "Amir is pacing when you come upon him, venting his frustrations aloud in little half-sentences. He looks positively furious."
msgstr ""

#: amir_mirror/surface_level5/0/14
msgctxt "Amir"
msgid "Ungh!"
msgstr ""

#: amir_mirror/surface_level5/0/22
msgctxt "Amir"
msgid "Unbelievable!"
msgstr ""

#: amir_mirror/surface_level5/0/30
msgctxt "Amir"
msgid "How dare- after I- how-"
msgstr ""

#: amir_mirror/surface_level5/0/38
msgctxt "Amir"
msgid "UNGH!"
msgstr ""

#: amir_mirror/surface_level5/0/49/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I'm getting a feeling that something is bothering you."
msgstr ""

#: amir_mirror/surface_level5/0/50/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Woah. Fully in drama mode, I see. What's wrong?"
msgstr ""

#: amir_mirror/surface_level5/0/c-0/7
msgctxt "Amir"
msgid "What? No!"
msgstr ""

#: amir_mirror/surface_level5/0/c-0/15
msgctxt "Amir"
msgid "...perhaps."
msgstr ""

#: amir_mirror/surface_level5/0/c-1/7
msgctxt "Amir"
msgid "Drama mode? Well, IF I were in drama mode, it would be warranted but as I am not, and nothing is wrong, then... well."
msgstr ""

#: amir_mirror/surface_level5/0/c-1/15
msgctxt "Amir"
msgid "Perhaps it is not nothing."
msgstr ""

#: amir_mirror/surface_level5/0/g-0/0
msgctxt "Amir"
msgid "Why do you ask?"
msgstr ""

#: amir_mirror/surface_level5/0/g-0/8/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "You seem really unhappy right now."
msgstr ""

#: amir_mirror/surface_level5/0/g-0/9/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Just a lucky guess. I had no clues at all."
msgstr ""

#: amir_mirror/surface_level5/0/g-1/0
msgctxt "Amir"
msgid "You are so perceptive, joonam. I love that about you."
msgstr ""

#: amir_mirror/surface_level5/0/g-1/8
msgctxt "Amir"
msgid "I suppose I am feeling a bit stressed."
msgstr ""

#: amir_mirror/surface_level5/0/g-1/16/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I'm here if you want to talk about it."
msgstr ""

#: amir_mirror/surface_level5/0/g-1/17/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Come on, don't make me drag it out of you. Dish!"
msgstr ""

#: amir_mirror/surface_level5/0/g-1/c-5/7
msgctxt "Amir"
msgid "Dish I shall."
msgstr ""

#: amir_mirror/surface_level5/0/g-2/0
msgctxt "Amir"
msgid "There have been some tensions lately."
msgstr ""

#: amir_mirror/surface_level5/0/g-2/8
msgctxt "Amir"
msgid "I am ashamed to say I have been <i>clouded</i> by them."
msgstr ""

#: amir_mirror/surface_level5/0/g-2/16
msgctxt "Amir"
msgid "That talentless, low pressure <i>hack</i> of a singing shower steamed up the entire bathroom again while I was taking my beauty nap."
msgstr ""

#: amir_mirror/surface_level5/0/g-2/27
msgctxt "Amir"
msgid "And while I was resting, Jean-Loo DREW all over my FACE in the STEAM!"
msgstr ""

#: amir_mirror/surface_level5/0/g-2/38
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "He gestures to himself, Jean-Loo's crimes evident all over his reflective surface."
msgstr ""

#: amir_mirror/surface_level5/0/g-2/46
msgctxt "Amir"
msgid "Look at this, just look! Look at what he has done!"
msgstr ""

#: amir_mirror/surface_level5/0/g-2/57
msgctxt "Amir"
msgid "His greasy little toilet-prints will never come off!"
msgstr ""

#: amir_mirror/surface_level5/0/g-2/65
msgctxt "Amir"
msgid "Who does he think he is?!"
msgstr ""

#: amir_mirror/surface_level5/0/g-2/73
msgctxt "Amir"
msgid "I cannot stand to be in the same space as him!"
msgstr ""

#: amir_mirror/surface_level5/0/g-2/81/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "That's awful! Here, I'll clean you up."
msgstr ""

#: amir_mirror/surface_level5/0/g-2/82/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I hear you're upset. But... it is a <i>little</i> funny."
msgstr ""

#: amir_mirror/surface_level5/0/g-2/c-6/7
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "You give Amir a thorough cleaning, erasing all trace of Jean-Loo's grubby little hands."
msgstr ""

#: amir_mirror/surface_level5/0/g-2/c-6/26
msgctxt "Amir"
msgid "...oh."
msgstr ""

#: amir_mirror/surface_level5/0/g-2/c-6/34
msgctxt "Amir"
msgid "Your touch... is exquisite."
msgstr ""

#: amir_mirror/surface_level5/0/g-2/c-6/42
msgctxt "Amir"
msgid "Thank you for making me presentable and reflective once more."
msgstr ""

#: amir_mirror/surface_level5/0/g-2/c-7/19
msgctxt "Amir"
msgid "I fail to see the humor."
msgstr ""

#: amir_mirror/surface_level5/0/g-2/c-7/27/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Hm. Yeah. I see you are definitely not laughing."
msgstr ""

#: amir_mirror/surface_level5/0/g-2/c-7/27/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Lighten up, it's not that bad!"
msgstr ""

#: amir_mirror/surface_level5/0/g-2/c-7/27/c-0/7
msgctxt "Amir"
msgid "But you are, so that works! We have created a perfect balance of laughing and not laughing."
msgstr ""

#: amir_mirror/surface_level5/0/g-2/c-7/27/c-0/18
msgctxt "Amir"
msgid "And since you <i>clearly</i> have more laughing still to do, I'll just go and get to my scrubbing!"
msgstr ""

#: amir_mirror/surface_level5/0/g-2/c-7/27/c-1/7
msgctxt "Amir"
msgid "I see. Well. If you are only going to make it worse, this humiliation I am feeling, you can do it by yourself."
msgstr ""

#: amir_mirror/surface_level5/0/g-2/c-7/27/c-1/15
msgctxt "Amir"
msgid "You may leave."
msgstr ""

#: amir_mirror/surface_level5/0/g-2/c-7/27/c-1/23/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Oh Amir, I'm really sorry."
msgstr ""

#: amir_mirror/surface_level5/0/g-2/c-7/27/c-1/23/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Come on. Don't be like that."
msgstr ""

#: amir_mirror/surface_level5/0/g-2/c-7/27/c-1/23/g-0/0
msgctxt "Amir"
msgid "Go, out! Out! Bodo!"
msgstr ""

#. Morceau de phrase coupé par une variable (nom du joueur, nombre...).
#: amir_mirror/surface_level6/0/12
msgctxt "Amir"
msgid "Ah, my very favorite reflection!"
msgstr ""

#. Morceau de phrase coupé par une variable (nom du joueur, nombre...).
#: amir_mirror/surface_level6/0/26
msgctxt "Amir"
msgid "Hm. It is you. Still my favorite reflection but having to wait out the fog was unbearable while the others laughed."
msgstr ""

#. Morceau de phrase coupé par une variable (nom du joueur, nombre...).
#: amir_mirror/surface_level6/0/40
msgctxt "Amir"
msgid "Ah, but patience is a virtue. So."
msgstr ""

#: amir_mirror/surface_level6/0/48
msgctxt "Amir"
msgid "Did you need something?"
msgstr ""

#: amir_mirror/surface_level6/0/56/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I could use a pep talk"
msgstr ""

#: amir_mirror/surface_level6/0/57/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Some cheering up wouldn't hurt."
msgstr ""

#: amir_mirror/surface_level6/0/g-0/0
msgctxt "Amir"
msgid "Ahhh and of course you thought to come to me, your closest and most treasured friend. I am touched."
msgstr ""

#: amir_mirror/surface_level6/0/g-0/8
msgctxt "Amir"
msgid "You have also made the correct decision. There is not another being in the house who can \"pep\" you like me!"
msgstr ""

#: amir_mirror/surface_level6/0/g-0/16/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "See, I knew it. I felt your skill instinctively."
msgstr ""

#: amir_mirror/surface_level6/0/g-0/17/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Best friend? Um, sure. We can go with that for now."
msgstr ""

#: amir_mirror/surface_level6/0/g-0/c-3/7
msgctxt "Amir"
msgid "For now."
msgstr ""

#: amir_mirror/surface_level6/0/g-1/0
msgctxt "Amir"
msgid "Tell me, what is troubling you, hm?"
msgstr ""

#: amir_mirror/surface_level6/0/g-1/8/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I'm just not feeling myself, you know?"
msgstr ""

#: amir_mirror/surface_level6/0/g-1/9/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Do you think I'm boring?"
msgstr ""

#: amir_mirror/surface_level6/0/g-1/c-5/7
msgctxt "Amir"
msgid "Boring?! Would you call the sun boring for rising?"
msgstr ""

#: amir_mirror/surface_level6/0/g-1/c-5/15
msgctxt "Amir"
msgid "Or a rose for blooming?"
msgstr ""

#: amir_mirror/surface_level6/0/g-1/c-5/23/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I feel like the right answer is... no?"
msgstr ""

#: amir_mirror/surface_level6/0/g-1/c-5/23/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Nope. Those things are both beautiful."
msgstr ""

#: amir_mirror/surface_level6/0/g-1/c-5/23/2/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I mean, a little..."
msgstr ""

#: amir_mirror/surface_level6/0/g-1/c-5/23/c-0/7
msgctxt "Amir"
msgid "You're correct!"
msgstr ""

#: amir_mirror/surface_level6/0/g-1/c-5/23/c-0/15
msgctxt "Amir"
msgid "You are so wise, to feel the correctness of your answer, azizam."
msgstr ""

#: amir_mirror/surface_level6/0/g-1/c-5/23/c-1/7
msgctxt "Amir"
msgid "That they are! Beautiful, and steadfast, and consistent and necessary for life!"
msgstr ""

#: amir_mirror/surface_level6/0/g-1/c-5/23/c-2/7
msgctxt "Amir"
msgid "Ah, I see what we have here maybe is a misunderstanding of the word boring. It does not mean consistent, or steadfast, or present."
msgstr ""

#: amir_mirror/surface_level6/0/g-1/c-5/23/c-2/15
msgctxt "Amir"
msgid "Those are all good qualities."
msgstr ""

#: amir_mirror/surface_level6/0/g-2/0
msgctxt "Amir"
msgid "So no, you would not call the sun or a rose boring. To do so would be untrue."
msgstr ""

#: amir_mirror/surface_level6/0/g-2/8
msgctxt "Amir"
msgid "Their beauty lies in existing, and you would not judge a thing harshly for being what, or who, it truly is."
msgstr ""

#: amir_mirror/surface_level6/0/g-2/16/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Wow... that was actually really helpful."
msgstr ""

#: amir_mirror/surface_level6/0/g-2/17/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "A little corny but somehow it still made me feel better."
msgstr ""

#: amir_mirror/surface_level6/0/g-2/c-6/7
msgctxt "Amir"
msgid "Of course it was."
msgstr ""

#: amir_mirror/surface_level6/0/g-2/c-7/7
msgctxt "Amir"
msgid "Of course you do. Some corn is very good for the spirit, I find!"
msgstr ""

#: amir_mirror/surface_level6/0/g-2/c-7/15
msgctxt "Amir"
msgid "And the complexion. It makes a really excellent brightening serum."
msgstr ""

#: amir_mirror/surface_level6/0/g-3/0
msgctxt "Amir"
msgid "And these are the things that I am here for."
msgstr ""

#: amir_mirror/surface_level6/0/g-3/8
msgctxt "Amir"
msgid "Now take your fully restored and re-pepped self out and seize the day!"
msgstr ""

#: amir_mirror/surface_level6/0/g-3/16
msgctxt "Amir"
msgid "Or whatever you kids say. Personally, I do not understand \"seizing the day.\" It sounds like maybe the day has committed a crime? It must be seized?"
msgstr ""

#: amir_mirror/surface_level6/0/g-3/24
msgctxt "Amir"
msgid "I don't know. I trust you know what that phrase is supposed to inspire."
msgstr ""

#: amir_mirror/surface_level6/0/g-3/36/0
msgctxt "Amir"
msgid "What do you mean you are not feeling yourself?"
msgstr ""

#: amir_mirror/surface_level6/0/g-3/36/8
msgctxt "Amir"
msgid "Of course you are not feeling yourself, look at you!"
msgstr ""

#: amir_mirror/surface_level6/0/g-3/36/16/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Ouch."
msgstr ""

#: amir_mirror/surface_level6/0/g-3/36/17/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "What's that supposed to mean?"
msgstr ""

#: amir_mirror/surface_level6/0/g-4/0
msgctxt "Amir"
msgid "<i>Look</i> at yourself."
msgstr ""

#: amir_mirror/surface_level6/0/g-4/11
msgctxt "Amir"
msgid "Really look."
msgstr ""

#: amir_mirror/surface_level6/0/g-4/19
msgctxt "Amir"
msgid "When was the last time you appreciated what you saw, hm?"
msgstr ""

#: amir_mirror/surface_level6/0/g-4/27/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "A while."
msgstr ""

#: amir_mirror/surface_level6/0/g-4/28/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I try to avoid looking, honestly."
msgstr ""

#: amir_mirror/surface_level6/0/g-5/0
msgctxt "Amir"
msgid "Exactly."
msgstr ""

#: amir_mirror/surface_level6/0/g-5/8
msgctxt "Amir"
msgid "You are not feeling yourself because you are not <i>seeing</i> yourself."
msgstr ""

#: amir_mirror/surface_level6/0/g-5/16
msgctxt "Amir"
msgid "How can you appreciate what you have when you are not willing to see it?"
msgstr ""

#: amir_mirror/surface_level6/0/g-5/24/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I guess you've got a point."
msgstr ""

#: amir_mirror/surface_level6/0/g-5/25/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "It's hard."
msgstr ""

#: amir_mirror/surface_level6/0/g-6/0
msgctxt "Amir"
msgid "Come, I want you to gaze at yourself without judgement, without turning away. Just seeing."
msgstr ""

#: amir_mirror/surface_level6/0/g-6/8/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Do I have to?"
msgstr ""

#: amir_mirror/surface_level6/0/g-6/9/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Alright, I'll try."
msgstr ""

#: amir_mirror/surface_level6/0/g-7/0
msgctxt "Amir"
msgid "Good, do this for 30 seconds. Starting... now!"
msgstr ""

#: amir_mirror/surface_level6/0/g-7/8
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "You look at Amir, and he looks at you, neither of you saying a word."
msgstr ""

#: amir_mirror/surface_level6/0/g-7/28/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "This is so awkward."
msgstr ""

#: amir_mirror/surface_level6/0/g-7/29/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I feel like you're just staring at me right now."
msgstr ""

#: amir_mirror/surface_level6/0/g-8/0
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "Amir lifts a finger to his lips, shutting you down swiftly."
msgstr ""

#: amir_mirror/surface_level6/0/g-8/8
msgctxt "Amir"
msgid "SHHH!"
msgstr ""

#: amir_mirror/surface_level6/0/g-8/16
msgctxt "Amir"
msgid "No talking! Only seeing!"
msgstr ""

#: amir_mirror/surface_level6/0/g-8/24
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "You continue to stare at each other. It's difficult to look so directly at someone as gorgeous as Amir."
msgstr ""

#: amir_mirror/surface_level6/0/g-8/47
msgctxt "Amir"
msgid "Khob, you may talk now."
msgstr ""

#: amir_mirror/surface_level6/0/g-8/55
msgctxt "Amir"
msgid "How do you feel?"
msgstr ""

#: amir_mirror/surface_level6/0/g-8/63/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Like I have no idea what I'm doing."
msgstr ""

#: amir_mirror/surface_level6/0/g-8/64/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Like... I'm not so bad to look at."
msgstr ""

#: amir_mirror/surface_level6/0/g-8/65/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I feel worse."
msgstr ""

#: amir_mirror/surface_level6/0/g-8/c-18/7
msgctxt "Amir"
msgid "It takes time to learn to see yourself."
msgstr ""

#: amir_mirror/surface_level6/0/g-8/c-18/18
msgctxt "Amir"
msgid "Keep practicing."
msgstr ""

#: amir_mirror/surface_level6/0/g-8/c-18/26
msgctxt "Amir"
msgid "But until then, I will see for you. And what I see is... magnificent."
msgstr ""

#: amir_mirror/surface_level6/0/g-8/c-19/7
msgctxt "Amir"
msgid "Magnificent, isn't it?"
msgstr ""

#: amir_mirror/surface_level6/0/g-8/c-20/7
msgctxt "Amir"
msgid "Then I am terribly sorry for trying."
msgstr ""

#: amir_mirror/surface_level6/0/g-8/c-20/15
msgctxt "Amir"
msgid "If you would trust me, perhaps we can try again later."
msgstr ""

#: amir_mirror/amir_trust_ending/0/0 amir_mirror/self_reflection/0/4
msgctxt "Amir"
msgid "Ah, my favorite reflection has returned!"
msgstr ""

#: amir_mirror/amir_trust_ending/0/8/s/0 amir_mirror/self_reflection/0/12/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "You say that to me a lot, you know."
msgstr ""

#: amir_mirror/amir_trust_ending/0/9/s/0 amir_mirror/self_reflection/0/13/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Am I really your favorite?"
msgstr ""

#: amir_mirror/amir_trust_ending/0/c-0/7 amir_mirror/self_reflection/0/c-0/7
msgctxt "Amir"
msgid "Because it is true a lot!"
msgstr ""

#: amir_mirror/amir_trust_ending/0/c-1/7 amir_mirror/self_reflection/0/c-1/7
msgctxt "Amir"
msgid "How could you even ask such a thing?"
msgstr ""

#: amir_mirror/amir_trust_ending/0/g-0/0 amir_mirror/self_reflection/0/g-0/0
msgctxt "Amir"
msgid "If it were not true, then I simply would not say it."
msgstr ""

#: amir_mirror/amir_trust_ending/0/g-0/8
msgctxt "Amir"
msgid "Do you love me as much as I love you?"
msgstr ""

#: amir_mirror/amir_trust_ending/0/g-0/16/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Yes, Amir, I do."
msgstr ""

#: amir_mirror/amir_trust_ending/0/g-0/17/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Not yet... I still feel like I only know you on a surface level."
msgstr ""

#: amir_mirror/amir_trust_ending/0/g-0/c-2/7
msgctxt "Amir"
msgid "This... this is wondrous."
msgstr ""

#: amir_mirror/amir_trust_ending/0/g-0/c-2/15
msgctxt "Amir"
msgid "I am so happy that you see in yourself what I see in you."
msgstr ""

#: amir_mirror/amir_trust_ending/0/g-0/c-2/23
msgctxt "Amir"
msgid "Come to me... my beautiful reflection..."
msgstr ""

#: amir_mirror/amir_trust_ending/0/g-0/c-3/7
msgctxt "Amir"
msgid "The surface? Azizam, I go deeper than just that."
msgstr ""

#: amir_mirror/amir_trust_ending/0/g-0/c-3/15
msgctxt "Amir"
msgid "You will see... there is more to me than simply my outward appearance."
msgstr ""

#: amir_mirror/self_reflection/0/g-0/8
msgctxt "Amir"
msgid "It is very easy to not say it."
msgstr ""

#: amir_mirror/self_reflection/0/g-0/16
msgctxt "Amir"
msgid "Ah, my <i>not</i> favorite reflection!"
msgstr ""

#: amir_mirror/self_reflection/0/g-0/24
msgctxt "Amir"
msgid "See? Very easy. Awkward, but easy."
msgstr ""

#: amir_mirror/self_reflection/0/g-0/35/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Cute, but I'm not convinced."
msgstr ""

#: amir_mirror/self_reflection/0/g-0/36/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Come on, I'm being serious."
msgstr ""

#: amir_mirror/self_reflection/0/g-1/0/b/1
msgctxt "Amir"
msgid "Why is it so difficult for you to accept my affections, hm?"
msgstr ""

#: amir_mirror/self_reflection/0/g-1/3/b/1
msgctxt "Amir"
msgid "You have accepted my commendations in the past. But it is not enough? Why so?"
msgstr ""

#: amir_mirror/self_reflection/0/g-1/6/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Sorry, I'm just bad at accepting compliments."
msgstr ""

#: amir_mirror/self_reflection/0/g-1/7/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Because I think you're full of it."
msgstr ""

#: amir_mirror/self_reflection/0/g-1/8/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Sorry I just don't buy it."
msgstr ""

#: amir_mirror/self_reflection/0/g-1/c-4/7
msgctxt "Amir"
msgid "Perhaps you are over-complicating it. Or perhaps you are not used to it!"
msgstr ""

#: amir_mirror/self_reflection/0/g-1/c-4/15
msgctxt "Amir"
msgid "It is very easy to accept nice things, especially with a little bit of practice."
msgstr ""

#: amir_mirror/self_reflection/0/g-1/c-4/23/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "It makes me nervous when people are too nice."
msgstr ""

#: amir_mirror/self_reflection/0/g-1/c-4/23/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "It's hard to practice something that makes you uncomfortable!"
msgstr ""

#: amir_mirror/self_reflection/0/g-1/c-4/23/c-0/7
msgctxt "Amir"
msgid "I don't understand. Why would such a thing make you nervous?"
msgstr ""

#: amir_mirror/self_reflection/0/g-1/c-4/23/c-0/15/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Because people are usually only nice when they want something."
msgstr ""

#: amir_mirror/self_reflection/0/g-1/c-4/23/c-0/15/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I don't know. Feels like a trap."
msgstr ""

#: amir_mirror/self_reflection/0/g-1/c-4/23/c-0/15/g-0/0
msgctxt "Amir"
msgid "Ah, this feeling I am having... yes. Sadness."
msgstr ""

#: amir_mirror/self_reflection/0/g-1/c-4/23/c-0/15/g-0/8 amir_mirror/self_reflection/0/g-1/c-5/15/g-0/c-2/23/g-1/0
msgctxt "Amir"
msgid "That is the saddest thing I have ever heard."
msgstr ""

#: amir_mirror/self_reflection/0/g-1/c-4/23/c-0/15/g-0/16/s/0 amir_mirror/self_reflection/0/g-1/c-5/15/g-0/c-2/23/g-1/8/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Yeah, yeah. Go ahead, I'm a loser I know."
msgstr ""

#: amir_mirror/self_reflection/0/g-1/c-4/23/c-0/15/g-0/17/s/0 amir_mirror/self_reflection/0/g-1/c-5/15/g-0/c-2/23/g-1/9/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "That's my life in a nutshell."
msgstr ""

#: amir_mirror/self_reflection/0/g-1/c-4/23/c-0/15/g-1/0 amir_mirror/self_reflection/0/g-1/c-5/15/g-0/c-2/23/g-2/0
msgctxt "Amir"
msgid "No, <i>you</i> are not sad. What you said is sad because you believe it."
msgstr ""

#: amir_mirror/self_reflection/0/g-1/c-4/23/c-0/15/g-1/8 amir_mirror/self_reflection/0/g-1/c-5/15/g-0/c-2/23/g-2/8
msgctxt "Amir"
msgid "You deserve nice things and to be treated with tenderness."
msgstr ""

#: amir_mirror/self_reflection/0/g-1/c-4/23/c-0/15/g-1/16 amir_mirror/self_reflection/0/g-1/c-5/15/g-0/c-2/23/g-2/16
msgctxt "Amir"
msgid "I am sorry for whatever happened to make you believe otherwise."
msgstr ""

#: amir_mirror/self_reflection/0/g-1/c-4/23/c-0/15/g-1/24/s/0 amir_mirror/self_reflection/0/g-1/c-5/15/g-0/c-2/23/g-2/24/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I-... feel so uncomfortable but also that's really sweet."
msgstr ""

#: amir_mirror/self_reflection/0/g-1/c-4/23/c-0/15/g-1/25/s/0 amir_mirror/self_reflection/0/g-1/c-5/15/g-0/c-2/23/g-2/25/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Sorry, one sec, there's uh something in my eye."
msgstr ""

#: amir_mirror/self_reflection/0/g-1/c-4/23/c-0/15/g-2/0 amir_mirror/self_reflection/0/g-1/c-5/15/g-0/c-2/23/g-3/0
msgctxt "Amir"
msgid "Do not worry, azizam."
msgstr ""

#: amir_mirror/self_reflection/0/g-1/c-4/23/c-0/15/g-2/8 amir_mirror/self_reflection/0/g-1/c-5/15/g-0/c-2/23/g-3/8
msgctxt "Amir"
msgid "I will make sure you receive that care from now on."
msgstr ""

#: amir_mirror/self_reflection/0/g-1/c-4/23/c-1/7
msgctxt "Amir"
msgid "Of course, I understand. It would be like me asking you to practice dancing in front of me to improve your moves."
msgstr ""

#: amir_mirror/self_reflection/0/g-1/c-4/23/c-1/15
msgctxt "Amir"
msgid "I am imagining it might make you very uncomfortable to dance in front of your mirror?"
msgstr ""

#: amir_mirror/self_reflection/0/g-1/c-4/23/c-1/23/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Yep, you'd be correct about that."
msgstr ""

#: amir_mirror/self_reflection/0/g-1/c-4/23/c-1/23/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Hell no, actually, I'm a great dancer."
msgstr ""

#: amir_mirror/self_reflection/0/g-1/c-4/23/c-1/23/g-0/0
msgctxt "Amir"
msgid "Well, the practice of receiving affection is very much the same!"
msgstr ""

#: amir_mirror/self_reflection/0/g-1/c-4/23/c-1/23/g-0/8
msgctxt "Amir"
msgid "Sometimes, you must first unlearn the moves you are accustomed to. You must learn to see yourself with the same tenderness as those around you."
msgstr ""

#: amir_mirror/self_reflection/0/g-1/c-4/23/c-1/23/g-0/16
msgctxt "Amir"
msgid "Do you see, azizam? Does this sound right to you?"
msgstr ""

#: amir_mirror/self_reflection/0/g-1/c-4/23/c-1/23/g-0/24/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Yeah. I guess I could try that."
msgstr ""

#: amir_mirror/self_reflection/0/g-1/c-4/23/c-1/23/g-0/25/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I'm just not sure. I love the effort you're giving me, though."
msgstr ""

#: amir_mirror/self_reflection/0/g-1/c-4/23/c-1/23/g-1/0
msgctxt "Amir"
msgid "Azizam, I am on your side. Always, and in all ways."
msgstr ""

#: amir_mirror/self_reflection/0/g-1/c-4/23/c-1/23/g-1/8
msgctxt "Amir"
msgid "Whatever you need, if I can provide it, it's yours."
msgstr ""

#: amir_mirror/self_reflection/0/g-1/c-5/7
msgctxt "Amir"
msgid "Yes! I am full of it! Affection is what you're meaning, yes? Because I am very full of that."
msgstr ""

#: amir_mirror/self_reflection/0/g-1/c-5/15/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I mean I think you're lying."
msgstr ""

#: amir_mirror/self_reflection/0/g-1/c-5/15/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "No, full of it like faking. Full of... nonsense."
msgstr ""

#: amir_mirror/self_reflection/0/g-1/c-5/15/c-0/7
msgctxt "Amir"
msgid "Lying? You think I..."
msgstr ""

#: amir_mirror/self_reflection/0/g-1/c-5/15/c-0/15
msgctxt "Amir"
msgid "You think I LIE to you??"
msgstr ""

#: amir_mirror/self_reflection/0/g-1/c-5/15/c-1/7
msgctxt "Amir"
msgid "Full of nonsense. So, the things I am full of, that are coming out of me are nonsensical? Not real? Not true??"
msgstr ""

#: amir_mirror/self_reflection/0/g-1/c-5/15/g-0/8
msgctxt "Amir"
msgid "How could you accuse me of such a thing?"
msgstr ""

#: amir_mirror/self_reflection/0/g-1/c-5/15/g-0/16
msgctxt "Amir"
msgid "I would never mislead you. I COULD never mislead you!"
msgstr ""

#: amir_mirror/self_reflection/0/g-1/c-5/15/g-0/24/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I have a hard time believing that."
msgstr ""

#: amir_mirror/self_reflection/0/g-1/c-5/15/g-0/c-2/7
msgctxt "Amir"
msgid "Am I not good to you?"
msgstr ""

#: amir_mirror/self_reflection/0/g-1/c-5/15/g-0/c-2/15
msgctxt "Amir"
msgid "Perhaps I have not reflected on your beauty enough, I shall double my efforts!"
msgstr ""

#: amir_mirror/self_reflection/0/g-1/c-5/15/g-0/c-2/23/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "No, that's exactly the problem! It makes me nervous when people are too nice."
msgstr ""

#: amir_mirror/self_reflection/0/g-1/c-5/15/g-0/c-2/23/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "You don't get it, it's too much already."
msgstr ""

#: amir_mirror/self_reflection/0/g-1/c-5/15/g-0/c-2/23/c-0/7
msgctxt "Amir"
msgid "Ah, I see. But I don't understand. Why would such a thing make you nervous?"
msgstr ""

#: amir_mirror/self_reflection/0/g-1/c-5/15/g-0/c-2/23/c-1/7
msgctxt "Amir"
msgid "I don't understand. Why would you not want my full affections? Are you saying that I am too much?"
msgstr ""

#: amir_mirror/self_reflection/0/g-1/c-5/15/g-0/c-2/23/g-0/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Because usually others are only nice when they want something."
msgstr ""

#: amir_mirror/self_reflection/0/g-1/c-5/15/g-0/c-2/23/g-0/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I don't know, it feels like a trap."
msgstr ""

#: amir_mirror/self_reflection/0/g-1/c-6/7/b/1
msgctxt "Amir"
msgid "I am beginning to find your lack of trust quite insulting."
msgstr ""

#: amir_mirror/self_reflection/0/g-1/c-6/10
msgctxt "Amir"
msgid "Have I not been good to you? Genuine in my feelings, generous with my affections."
msgstr ""

#: amir_mirror/self_reflection/0/g-1/c-6/18
msgctxt "Amir"
msgid "Is this not enough to prove my integrity?"
msgstr ""

#: amir_mirror/self_reflection/0/g-1/c-6/26/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "It just feels like a scam."
msgstr ""

#: amir_mirror/self_reflection/0/g-1/c-6/26/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Honestly I just hate sappy stuff."
msgstr ""

#: amir_mirror/self_reflection/0/g-1/c-6/26/g-0/0
msgctxt "Amir"
msgid "Very well then. It pains me very much to say what I have to say now..."
msgstr ""

#: amir_mirror/self_reflection/0/g-1/c-6/26/g-0/8
msgctxt "Amir"
msgid "...but it has become clear that I am not wanted here. What I have to offer is not welcome with you."
msgstr ""

#: amir_mirror/self_reflection/0/g-1/c-6/26/g-0/16
msgctxt "Amir"
msgid "Perhaps, for both of our sakes, you would do well to spend your time elsewhere from now on."
msgstr ""

#: amir_mirror/self_reflection/0/g-1/c-6/26/g-0/24
msgctxt "Amir"
msgid "I would never want you to do anything that did not bring you joy."
msgstr ""

#: amir_mirror/all_fogged_up/0/4
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "The sound of Johnny's distinct vocals and a blast of steam hit you all at once as you enter the bathroom. Amir is wincing, calling out over the noise."
msgstr ""

#: amir_mirror/all_fogged_up/0/12
msgctxt "Amir"
msgid "Ahh Johnny, as vocally blessed as you are..."
msgstr ""

#: amir_mirror/all_fogged_up/0/23
msgctxt "Amir"
msgid "Don't you think that is enough for today?"
msgstr ""

#: amir_mirror/all_fogged_up/0/31
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "Johnny continues singing—you can't tell if he's just not heard Amir or if he's ignoring him."
msgstr ""

#: amir_mirror/all_fogged_up/0/39
msgctxt "Johnny"
msgid "<w>OH HU HU HU HU HO HU HU HO HO</w>"
msgstr ""

#: amir_mirror/all_fogged_up/0/47
msgctxt "Amir"
msgid "Johnny?"
msgstr ""

#: amir_mirror/all_fogged_up/0/55
msgctxt "Johnny"
msgid "<w>AH HE UH HI HA! HUNUHUNUHUNU HO HU HUHHH</w>"
msgstr ""

#: amir_mirror/all_fogged_up/0/60
msgctxt "Amir"
msgid "Johnny..."
msgstr ""

#: amir_mirror/all_fogged_up/0/71
msgctxt "Johnny"
msgid "<w>AHSO SWEET AH GRANPA AHOOOOOO</w>"
msgstr ""

#: amir_mirror/all_fogged_up/0/76
msgctxt "Amir"
msgid "JOHNNY!"
msgstr ""

#: amir_mirror/all_fogged_up/0/93
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "Johnny finally pulls the curtain back, turning to shoot Amir a glare."
msgstr ""

#: amir_mirror/all_fogged_up/0/101
msgctxt "Johnny"
msgid "What's your deal, shiny fella? Can't you hear I'm rehearsing over here?"
msgstr ""

#: amir_mirror/all_fogged_up/0/109
msgctxt "Amir"
msgid "Yes, I can. <i>That</i> is the problem! We can <i>all</i> hear you."
msgstr ""

#: amir_mirror/all_fogged_up/0/117
msgctxt "Amir"
msgid "I and everyone else in the bathroom, the bedroom, the <i>attic</i>, the whole house, Johnny!"
msgstr ""

#: amir_mirror/all_fogged_up/0/125
msgctxt "Amir"
msgid "I do not doubt that even the house across the street can hear you!"
msgstr ""

#: amir_mirror/all_fogged_up/0/133/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "What's with the yelling?"
msgstr ""

#: amir_mirror/all_fogged_up/0/134/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Should I... come back later?"
msgstr ""

#: amir_mirror/all_fogged_up/0/g-0/0/b/1
msgctxt "Amir"
msgid "Oh, azizam! I am so sorry. I did not see you come in."
msgstr ""

#: amir_mirror/all_fogged_up/0/g-0/3/b/1
msgctxt "Amir"
msgid "Oh, my love! I am so sorry. I did not see you come in."
msgstr ""

#: amir_mirror/all_fogged_up/0/g-0/6
msgctxt "Amir"
msgid "In fact, I cannot see anything, as I am completely FOGGED OVER."
msgstr ""

#: amir_mirror/all_fogged_up/0/g-0/14
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "Johnny doesn't bother waiting for any resolution to the conversation—he simply begins singing once more."
msgstr ""

#: amir_mirror/all_fogged_up/0/g-0/19
msgctxt "Johnny"
msgid "<i>Topeka Topeka Topeka Bodega Bodega Bodega</i>"
msgstr ""

#: amir_mirror/all_fogged_up/0/g-0/33
msgctxt "Johnny"
msgid "<w>Topeka Topeka Topeka Bodega Bodega Bodega</w>"
msgstr ""

#: amir_mirror/all_fogged_up/0/g-0/44
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "Amir lets out a growl—you didn't know he had it in him."
msgstr ""

#: amir_mirror/all_fogged_up/0/g-0/63
msgctxt "Amir"
msgid "Perhaps, because..."
msgstr ""

#: amir_mirror/all_fogged_up/0/g-0/71
msgctxt "Amir"
msgid "Johnny has spent the last <i>two hours</i> choking on that high D at the top of his pipes!"
msgstr ""

#: amir_mirror/all_fogged_up/0/g-0/79/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Not gonna make the choking on a high D joke. Nope."
msgstr ""

#: amir_mirror/all_fogged_up/0/g-0/80/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Wow. This is some dramatic infighting, you two!"
msgstr ""

#: amir_mirror/all_fogged_up/0/g-0/c-2/7
msgctxt "Amir"
msgid "Admirable restraint."
msgstr ""

#: amir_mirror/all_fogged_up/0/g-0/c-3/7
msgctxt "Amir"
msgid "I am dramatic, so that makes sense."
msgstr ""

#: amir_mirror/all_fogged_up/0/g-0/c-3/15
msgctxt "Johnny"
msgid "Understatement of the year, right there, fella!"
msgstr ""

#: amir_mirror/all_fogged_up/0/g-1/0
msgctxt "Johnny"
msgid "Settle down there, pretty baby. You're just jealous that Volt didn't offer you a spot in the show."
msgstr ""

#: amir_mirror/all_fogged_up/0/g-1/11
msgctxt "Amir"
msgid "HA! Absurd, of course he did. I simply did not want to steal the spotlight from everyone else, which I could clearly do, so I politely declined."
msgstr ""

#: amir_mirror/all_fogged_up/0/g-1/19
msgctxt "Johnny"
msgid "Well, what would your act even be?"
msgstr ""

#: amir_mirror/all_fogged_up/0/g-1/27
msgctxt "Amir"
msgid "No! I have an act, a very good one. Better than your lousy caterwauling."
msgstr ""

#: amir_mirror/all_fogged_up/0/g-1/35
msgctxt "Johnny"
msgid "Well what is it then Mr. Shiny?"
msgstr ""

#: amir_mirror/all_fogged_up/0/g-1/40
msgctxt "Amir"
msgid "It's..."
msgstr ""

#: amir_mirror/all_fogged_up/0/g-1/48
msgctxt "Amir"
msgid "Uhh well it's uhh... well, it's umm... I do, uhh... umm, hmm. Uhh..."
msgstr ""

#: amir_mirror/all_fogged_up/0/g-1/56/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Looking fabulous?"
msgstr ""

#: amir_mirror/all_fogged_up/0/g-1/57/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "A musical number?"
msgstr ""

#: amir_mirror/all_fogged_up/0/g-1/58/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "A magic act!"
msgstr ""

#: amir_mirror/all_fogged_up/0/g-1/c-4/7
msgctxt "Johnny"
msgid "Ah shucks that's a great talent!"
msgstr ""

#: amir_mirror/all_fogged_up/0/g-1/c-4/15
msgctxt "Johnny"
msgid "I always like looking at you, Amir."
msgstr ""

#: amir_mirror/all_fogged_up/0/g-1/c-5/7
msgctxt "Amir"
msgid "Yes, yes exactly. A musical number! One that wouldn't make the audience's ears bleed, unlike yours, Johnny!"
msgstr ""

#: amir_mirror/all_fogged_up/0/g-1/c-6/7
msgctxt "Johnny"
msgid "Does he make the audience disappear?"
msgstr ""

#: amir_mirror/all_fogged_up/0/g-1/c-6/15
msgctxt "Amir"
msgid "No, I'd hate to steal your act."
msgstr ""

#: amir_mirror/all_fogged_up/0/g-1/c-6/23
msgctxt "Johnny"
msgid "Yeah, yeah... keep laughing. We both know you're too much of a coward to actually set foot on that stage."
msgstr ""

#: amir_mirror/all_fogged_up/0/g-1/c-6/31
msgctxt "Amir"
msgid "Be careful, it is your fortune that I have chosen not to until now. That could easily change!"
msgstr ""

#: amir_mirror/all_fogged_up/0/g-2/0
msgctxt "Johnny"
msgid "I'll see you there!"
msgstr ""

#: amir_mirror/all_fogged_up/0/g-2/5
msgctxt "Amir"
msgid "Burst a pipe, you hack."
msgstr ""

#: amir_mirror/all_fogged_up/0/g-2/13
msgctxt "Johnny"
msgid "Hey not my fault I'm the only one here who's got star quality baby."
msgstr ""

#: amir_mirror/all_fogged_up/0/g-2/27
msgctxt "Amir"
msgid "I am sorry you had to be there for that."
msgstr ""

#: amir_mirror/all_fogged_up/0/g-2/35/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "That was intense."
msgstr ""

#: amir_mirror/all_fogged_up/0/g-2/36/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "You ok?"
msgstr ""

#: amir_mirror/all_fogged_up/0/g-2/37/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Are you kidding, that was awesome!"
msgstr ""

#: amir_mirror/all_fogged_up/0/g-2/38/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Hidden talents? Now I'm curious."
msgstr ""

#: amir_mirror/all_fogged_up/0/g-2/39/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Bring 'em all to the show! Blow him out of the water! So to speak."
msgstr ""

#: amir_mirror/all_fogged_up/0/g-2/c-7/7
msgctxt "Amir"
msgid "Existence in the bathroom often is."
msgstr ""

#: amir_mirror/all_fogged_up/0/g-2/c-8/7
msgctxt "Amir"
msgid "Do not worry, he would have to learn to actually hit a note before he could shatter anything."
msgstr ""

#: amir_mirror/all_fogged_up/0/g-2/c-9/7
msgctxt "Amir"
msgid "Hm. I wonder if you're reveling in my pain..."
msgstr ""

#: amir_mirror/all_fogged_up/0/g-2/c-9/15
msgctxt "Amir"
msgid "But no. I think you're just being amazing and enjoying what there is to enjoy about something difficult. I love that about you."
msgstr ""

#: amir_mirror/all_fogged_up/0/g-2/c-9/23
msgctxt "Amir"
msgid "Obviously I am a mirror of many talents. Some of them remain hidden even from you, and any one of them would be suited for live entertainment."
msgstr ""

#: amir_mirror/all_fogged_up/0/g-3/0
msgctxt "Amir"
msgid "Perhaps I will make an appearance at the show, with your encouragement."
msgstr ""

#: amir_mirror/all_fogged_up/0/g-3/11
msgctxt "Amir"
msgid "And of course, I would be more than happy to give you a demonstration..."
msgstr ""

#: amir_mirror/all_fogged_up/0/g-3/19
msgctxt "Amir"
msgid "...once I've had a chance to dry out."
msgstr ""

#: amir_mirror/all_fogged_up/0/g-3/27/b/1
msgctxt "Amir"
msgid "Thank you for coming by, my dearest reflection."
msgstr ""

#: amir_mirror/love_ending/0/0
msgctxt "Amir"
msgid "If you will have it, that is."
msgstr ""

#: amir_mirror/love_ending/0/8
msgctxt "Amir"
msgid "My care, my affection, my love. All that I am, all that I have to give, I lay at your feet."
msgstr ""

#: amir_mirror/love_ending/0/16/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "You make it sound so easy."
msgstr ""

#: amir_mirror/love_ending/0/17/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "How can you be so open like that? What if I said no?"
msgstr ""

#: amir_mirror/love_ending/0/c-0/7
msgctxt "Amir"
msgid "It is easy."
msgstr ""

#: amir_mirror/love_ending/0/c-0/15/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I feel like most of the history of romance in media would disagree."
msgstr ""

#: amir_mirror/love_ending/0/c-0/15/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Relationships are never easy. By definition."
msgstr ""

#: amir_mirror/love_ending/0/c-0/15/g-0/0
msgctxt "Amir"
msgid "You misunderstand. I am not asking anything from you."
msgstr ""

#: amir_mirror/love_ending/0/c-0/15/g-0/8
msgctxt "Amir"
msgid "Offering you my love is easy because it is what I feel, what was in my heart from the moment I first caught your reflection."
msgstr ""

#: amir_mirror/love_ending/0/c-0/15/g-0/16 amir_mirror/love_ending/0/c-1/31
msgctxt "Amir"
msgid "It beats for you, and only you. It is yours, completely, without question."
msgstr ""

#: amir_mirror/love_ending/0/c-0/15/g-0/24 amir_mirror/love_ending/0/c-1/39
msgctxt "Amir"
msgid "Whether you choose to accept it or not, the answer is the same. It belongs to you."
msgstr ""

#: amir_mirror/love_ending/0/c-0/15/g-0/32
msgctxt "Amir"
msgid "Nothing could be easier than giving you what is already yours."
msgstr ""

#: amir_mirror/love_ending/0/c-1/7
msgctxt "Amir"
msgid "Then you would say no, and nothing would change."
msgstr ""

#: amir_mirror/love_ending/0/c-1/15
msgctxt "Amir"
msgid "If you did not share my feelings, then you would be right to say it. I have no expectations of you."
msgstr ""

#: amir_mirror/love_ending/0/c-1/23
msgctxt "Amir"
msgid "I offer you my love because it is what I feel, what was in my heart from the moment I first caught your reflection."
msgstr ""

#: amir_mirror/love_ending/0/c-1/47
msgctxt "Amir"
msgid "I would never regret giving you what is already yours, even if you did not want it."
msgstr ""

#: amir_mirror/love_ending/0/g-0/0
msgctxt "Amir"
msgid "Doret begardam, azizam. Will you have me?"
msgstr ""

#: amir_mirror/love_ending/0/g-0/9/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I'm just as much yours as you are mine."
msgstr ""

#: amir_mirror/love_ending/0/g-0/9/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Look, you're great, really. But I think we're better as friends."
msgstr ""

#: amir_mirror/love_ending/0/g-0/9/c-2/7
msgctxt "Amir"
msgid "You see? As I said, it is easy when you know what you feel. We have been drawn together for a reason."
msgstr ""

#: amir_mirror/love_ending/0/g-0/9/c-2/15
msgctxt "Amir"
msgid "You do not need to fear being open anymore, azizam. I will look after your heart from now on."
msgstr ""

#: amir_mirror/love_ending/0/g-0/9/c-2/23
msgctxt "Amir"
msgid "It is safe with me."
msgstr ""

#: amir_mirror/love_ending/0/g-0/9/c-3/7
msgctxt "Amir"
msgid "Fadat sham, all that matters is your happiness."
msgstr ""

#: amir_mirror/hate_ending/3
msgctxt "Amir"
msgid "There are a great many things I would endure for you, azizam."
msgstr ""

#: amir_mirror/hate_ending/11
msgctxt "Amir"
msgid "I would shatter if you asked it of me."
msgstr ""

#: amir_mirror/hate_ending/19
msgctxt "Amir"
msgid "I would use the pieces of myself to light the night sky just to amuse you."
msgstr ""

#: amir_mirror/hate_ending/27
msgctxt "Amir"
msgid "But to take all I have offered you and return only mistrust..."
msgstr ""

#: amir_mirror/hate_ending/35
msgctxt "Amir"
msgid "That is more than even I can bear."
msgstr ""

#: amir_mirror/hate_ending/77
msgctxt "Reggie"
msgid "Couldn’t <i>see</i> yourself with him? Happens <i>all</i> the time."
msgstr ""

#: amir_mirror/hate_ending/85
msgctxt "Reggie"
msgid "Nice job. We'll reflect on this later."
msgstr ""

#: amir_mirror/amir_hate_return/0/0
msgctxt "Amir"
msgid "Ah, you are here."
msgstr ""

#: amir_mirror/amir_hate_return/0/8
msgctxt "Amir"
msgid "I would say what a pleasure it is to catch your reflection, azizam..."
msgstr ""

#: amir_mirror/amir_hate_return/0/16
msgctxt "Amir"
msgid "But I am afraid it is too painful now."
msgstr ""

#: amir_mirror/amir_hate_return/0/24
msgctxt "Amir"
msgid "It has left me covered with a distasteful haze, tainted by your mistrust."
msgstr ""

#: amir_mirror/amir_hate_return/0/32
msgctxt "Amir"
msgid "No doubt it will take ages to buff out."
msgstr ""

#: amir_mirror/amir_hate_return/0/40/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "What can I do about it?"
msgstr ""

#: amir_mirror/amir_hate_return/0/41/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Gaze into this face... and reconsider! (USE SASS CANDY)"
msgstr ""

#: amir_mirror/amir_hate_return/0/c-0/7
msgctxt "Amir"
msgid "I think it best if you found another surface to gaze into from now on."
msgstr ""

#: amir_mirror/amir_hate_return/0/c-1/13
msgctxt "Amir"
msgid "...I am gazing."
msgstr ""

#: amir_mirror/amir_hate_return/0/c-1/21
msgctxt "Amir"
msgid "I enjoy your form yes."
msgstr ""

#: amir_mirror/amir_hate_return/0/c-1/29
msgctxt "Amir"
msgid "But I feel you do not trust me when I say I have feelings for you."
msgstr ""

#: amir_mirror/amir_hate_return/0/c-1/37/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I was foolish not to trust you."
msgstr ""

#: amir_mirror/amir_hate_return/0/c-1/37/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I was stubborn."
msgstr ""

#: amir_mirror/amir_hate_return/0/c-1/37/c-0/7
msgctxt "Amir"
msgid "Undeniably. Continue."
msgstr ""

#: amir_mirror/amir_hate_return/0/c-1/37/c-0/15/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I didn't believe I deserved your kindness, so I pushed you away. But I didn't consider how much it would hurt you."
msgstr ""

#: amir_mirror/amir_hate_return/0/c-1/37/c-0/15/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I just couldn't believe someone would care for me when I care so little for myself."
msgstr ""

#: amir_mirror/amir_hate_return/0/c-1/37/c-0/15/g-0/0 amir_mirror/amir_hate_return/0/c-1/37/c-1/15/c-0/7
msgctxt "Amir"
msgid "It shatters me to know you think so little of yourself, azizam..."
msgstr ""

#: amir_mirror/amir_hate_return/0/c-1/37/c-1/7
msgctxt "Amir"
msgid "Yes. That is a very good word for it. Please go on."
msgstr ""

#: amir_mirror/amir_hate_return/0/c-1/37/c-1/15/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I couldn't believe how you felt about me because I couldn't believe it about myself."
msgstr ""

#: amir_mirror/amir_hate_return/0/c-1/37/c-1/15/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Trust is so scary for me. I took it out on you... and I'm sorry."
msgstr ""

#: amir_mirror/amir_hate_return/0/c-1/37/c-1/15/c-1/7
msgctxt "Amir"
msgid "It shatters me to know you are in so much pain, azizam..."
msgstr ""

#: amir_mirror/amir_hate_return/0/c-1/37/g-0/0
msgctxt "Amir"
msgid "I appreciate your honesty. I know it is difficult for you to open yourself like this."
msgstr ""

#: amir_mirror/amir_hate_return/0/c-1/37/g-0/8
msgctxt "Amir"
msgid "I wish you had shared with me sooner. But of course, it happened at exactly the moment it was supposed to."
msgstr ""

#: amir_mirror/amir_hate_return/0/c-1/37/g-0/16
msgctxt "Amir"
msgid "I suppose I was a bit... rash, before. I cannot help my own passions sometimes."
msgstr ""

#: amir_mirror/amir_hate_return/0/c-1/37/g-0/24
msgctxt "Amir"
msgid "Perhaps, we could still share a friendship."
msgstr ""

#: amir_mirror/amir_hate_return/0/c-1/37/g-0/32
msgctxt "Amir"
msgid "IF you agree to continue with honesty, that is."
msgstr ""

#: amir_mirror/amir_hate_return/0/c-1/37/g-0/40/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Yes. I think I can manage that."
msgstr ""

#: amir_mirror/amir_hate_return/0/c-1/37/g-0/41/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Honest communication. That'll be interesting."
msgstr ""

#: amir_mirror/amir_hate_return/0/c-1/37/g-1/0
msgctxt "Amir"
msgid "Good, anger does not suit my beauty anyway."
msgstr ""

#: amir_mirror/amir_love_return/0/0
msgctxt "Amir"
msgid "Eshgham, you are looking particularly radiant today."
msgstr ""

#: amir_mirror/amir_love_return/0/8/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "You know, I'm actually starting to believe you."
msgstr ""

#: amir_mirror/amir_love_return/0/9/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "You always know what to say."
msgstr ""

#: amir_mirror/amir_love_return/0/10/s/0 amir_mirror/amir_friend_return_2/0/10/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Actually, I'm here for you... I'd like to Realize you!"
msgstr ""

#: amir_mirror/amir_love_return/0/c-0/7
msgctxt "Amir"
msgid "Good! Then I am doing excellent work. As I would've expected!"
msgstr ""

#: amir_mirror/amir_love_return/0/c-0/15 amir_mirror/amir_love_return/0/c-1/15
msgctxt "Amir"
msgid "Truly, your beauty is an unrivaled thing."
msgstr ""

#: amir_mirror/amir_love_return/0/c-0/23 amir_mirror/amir_love_return/0/c-1/23
msgctxt "Amir"
msgid "I could gaze at only you for the rest of time and never know anything less than utter contentment."
msgstr ""

#: amir_mirror/amir_love_return/0/c-0/31 amir_mirror/amir_love_return/0/c-1/31
msgctxt "Amir"
msgid "Ghorboonetberam."
msgstr ""

#: amir_mirror/amir_love_return/0/c-1/7
msgctxt "Amir"
msgid "Poetry is simple when you have the right muse."
msgstr ""

#: amir_mirror/amir_friend_return_1/0/12
msgctxt "Amir"
msgid "Ah, you have returned!"
msgstr ""

#: amir_mirror/amir_friend_return_1/0/20
msgctxt "Amir"
msgid "Obviously you could not stay away from your most loving companion."
msgstr ""

#: amir_mirror/amir_friend_return_1/0/28
msgctxt "Amir"
msgid "I do not blame you, I too would choose my own company out of many in the house. Most, even."
msgstr ""

#: amir_mirror/amir_friend_return_1/0/36/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "You're in good spirits. I thought maybe things would be weird, you know, after..."
msgstr ""

#: amir_mirror/amir_friend_return_1/0/37/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "So... we're good? You're really not mad about the whole 'friends' thing?"
msgstr ""

#: amir_mirror/amir_friend_return_1/0/g-0/0
msgctxt "Amir"
msgid "Tsk Ahhh, do you think so little of me, joonam?"
msgstr ""

#: amir_mirror/amir_friend_return_1/0/g-0/8
msgctxt "Amir"
msgid "To be anything other than delighted to share in your friendship would be foolish!"
msgstr ""

#: amir_mirror/amir_friend_return_1/0/g-0/16
msgctxt "Amir"
msgid "And we are friends, yes?"
msgstr ""

#: amir_mirror/amir_friend_return_1/0/g-0/24/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Yeah, absolutely!"
msgstr ""

#: amir_mirror/amir_friend_return_1/0/g-0/25/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "You have such a great attitude. I'm grateful!"
msgstr ""

#: amir_mirror/amir_friend_return_1/0/g-1/0
msgctxt "Amir"
msgid "Then I count myself lucky to have you."
msgstr ""

#: amir_mirror/amir_friend_return_1/0/g-1/8
msgctxt "Amir"
msgid "Now, come. Let us discuss friend things."
msgstr ""

#: amir_mirror/amir_friend_return_1/0/g-1/16/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Ooh yes, let's. I imagine you'll explain that to me."
msgstr ""

#: amir_mirror/amir_friend_return_1/0/g-1/17/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Like what? What are 'friend things'? I'm intrigued."
msgstr ""

#: amir_mirror/amir_friend_return_1/0/g-1/c-4/7
msgctxt "Amir"
msgid "Oh, I will. Friend things are things that friends do together, things that require teamwork and mutual understanding."
msgstr ""

#: amir_mirror/amir_friend_return_1/0/g-1/c-4/15
msgctxt "Amir"
msgid "For us, it might be something like..."
msgstr ""

#: amir_mirror/amir_friend_return_1/0/g-2/0
msgctxt "Amir"
msgid "Like... how we are going to get Jean-Loo back for doing that artistically bereft graffiti on my face!"
msgstr ""

#: amir_mirror/amir_friend_return_2/0/0
msgctxt "Amir"
msgid "You're back again to visit! My friend. I do so delight in you!"
msgstr ""

#: amir_mirror/amir_friend_return_2/0/8/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I delight in you, too, Amir."
msgstr ""

#: amir_mirror/amir_friend_return_2/0/9/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "You're just so much fun to visit!"
msgstr ""

#: amir_mirror/amir_friend_return_2/0/c-0/7
msgctxt "Amir"
msgid "Mmm. I can feel myself blushing!"
msgstr ""

#: amir_mirror/amir_friend_return_2/0/c-0/15
msgctxt "Amir"
msgid "I do hope the color that's rising is flattering to my undertone..."
msgstr ""

#: amir_mirror/amir_friend_return_2/0/c-1/7
msgctxt "Amir"
msgid "I am! I am, indeed. And you're fun to be visited by!"
msgstr ""

#: amir_mirror/amir_friend_return_2/0/c-1/15
msgctxt "Amir"
msgid "Look at us reflecting off of each other."
msgstr ""

#: amir_mirror/amir_friend_return_2/0/c-1/23
msgctxt "Amir"
msgid "What a joy! It is so much fun to have so much fun. Don't you think?"
msgstr ""

#: amir_mirror/amir_friend_return_2/0/c-1/31
msgctxt "Amir"
msgid "Of course you do, azizam."
msgstr ""

#: amir_mirror/amir_realize_join/0/0
msgctxt "Amir"
msgid "Excitement! I'm not surprised we have come to this moment at last... I have known for some time what a marvelous human being I would make."
msgstr ""

#: amir_mirror/amir_realize_join/0/8
msgctxt "Amir"
msgid "I WILL make! Ah, yes. It is time!"
msgstr ""

#: amir_mirror/amir_realize_join/0/16
msgctxt "Amir"
msgid "You have the necessaries?"
msgstr ""

#: amir_mirror/amir_realize_join/0/33/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Let's get to it!"
msgstr ""

#: amir_mirror/amir_realize_join/0/34/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "You'll have to wait just a little longer, unfortunately..."
msgstr ""

#: amir_mirror/amir_realize_join/0/c-1/13
msgctxt "Amir"
msgid "Take your time, azizam. I will be here, reflecting."
msgstr ""

#: amir_mirror/amir_realize_return/0/0
msgctxt "Amir"
msgid "I've been practicing all my facial expressions I will use when I have a real face of my own!"
msgstr ""

#: amir_mirror/amir_realize_return/0/8
msgctxt "Amir"
msgid "Are you prepared? I certainly am!"
msgstr ""

#: amir_mirror/amir_realize_return/0/25/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Finally. All set!"
msgstr ""

#: amir_mirror/amir_realize_return/0/26/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Still not ready... soon, though!"
msgstr ""

#: amir_mirror/amir_realize_return/0/c-1/13
msgctxt "Amir"
msgid "There is no hurry."
msgstr ""

#: amir_mirror/amir_realize_return/0/c-1/21
msgctxt "Amir"
msgid "Still so much loveliness to reflect on before the change finally comes."
msgstr ""

#: amir_mirror/amir_realize_begin/6/b/1
msgctxt "Skylar"
msgid "Starting with some self-reflection, huh? Here goes nothing..."
msgstr ""

#: amir_mirror/amir_realize_begin/9
msgctxt "Skylar"
msgid "C'mon Amir, let's become human!"
msgstr ""

#: amir_mirror/amir_realize_begin/17
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "The spectral energy flows through your dateviators, and what was once merely a mirror, becomes...."
msgstr ""

#: amir_mirror/amir_realized/0/3
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "There's no shock, no wonder in the air as Amir takes stock of himself, inspecting his human body in the old mirror he once was. He simply nods, before turning to give you a coy smile."
msgstr ""

#: amir_mirror/amir_realized/0/8
msgctxt "Amir"
msgid "Yes."
msgstr ""

#: amir_mirror/amir_realized/0/16
msgctxt "Amir"
msgid "You see, azizam? I am incredible! Exactly as I knew it would be!"
msgstr ""

#: amir_mirror/amir_realized/0/24
msgctxt "Amir"
msgid "It is quite something to have a physical body now to experience the sensations I have only dreamed of until now!"
msgstr ""

#: amir_mirror/amir_realized/0/32
msgctxt "Amir"
msgid "How will I ever get enough of my own self, my own face, how will I ever get enough of sharing myself, adoring and receiving the adoration of others?"
msgstr ""

#: amir_mirror/amir_realized/0/40
msgctxt "Amir"
msgid "Oh, what an exciting question to ask!"
msgstr ""

#: amir_mirror/amir_realized/0/48/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "You, my friend, are lookin' good."
msgstr ""

#: amir_mirror/amir_realized/0/49/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Kiss me, you adorable fool. Kiss me under the eaves."
msgstr ""

#: amir_mirror/amir_realize_love_path/3
msgctxt "Amir"
msgid "Ah but my love, look at me now."
msgstr ""

#: amir_mirror/amir_realize_love_path/11
msgctxt "Amir"
msgid "I can kiss you anywhere we want! Anywhere I want."
msgstr ""

#: amir_mirror/amir_realize_love_path/19
msgctxt "Amir"
msgid "And with this new body, all this new power and the grace of sensuality..."
msgstr ""

#: amir_mirror/amir_realize_love_path/27
msgctxt "Amir"
msgid "Tell me. Give me my highest pleasure! Tell me where you would like me to kiss you!"
msgstr ""

#: amir_mirror/amir_realize_love_path/38
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "You had far too many answers to this particular question... but Amir, in his loving generosity, took his time satisfying every..."
msgstr ""

#: amir_mirror/amir_realize_love_path/43
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "...single..."
msgstr ""

#: amir_mirror/amir_realize_love_path/51
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "...one."
msgstr ""

#: amir_mirror/amir_realize_love_path/62
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "As so often happens, though, kissing led to so many other areas of exploration and experimentation."
msgstr ""

#: amir_mirror/amir_realize_love_path/70
msgctxt "Amir"
msgid "I could not be more grateful for you, azizam."
msgstr ""

#: amir_mirror/amir_realize_love_path/78
msgctxt "Amir"
msgid "There could not have been for me a better, more loving or more patient teacher."
msgstr ""

#: amir_mirror/amir_realize_love_path/86
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "The evening was athletic. The evening was restorative. And in the morning, fresh from the bliss of Amir's love, you wished him well in his new life."
msgstr ""

#: amir_mirror/amir_realize_friend_join/0
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "Amir, after searching and searching for the perfect way to honor himself and the love he felt for humanity, finally realized his calling."
msgstr ""

#: amir_mirror/amir_realize_friend_join/8
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "He moved to Hollywood and, after several months of challenging auditions, was hired as a series regular on The Soft and the Sensual."
msgstr ""

#: amir_mirror/amir_realize_friend_join/16
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "He played the character of Mehdi, a world-famous race car driver who moonlights as a prominent surgeon and has a bad habit of falling in love with all of his patients."
msgstr ""

#: amir_mirror/amir_realize_friend_join/24
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "In a case of life imitating art, Amir developed a habit of falling in love with all of his castmates."
msgstr ""

#: amir_mirror/amir_realize_friend_join/32
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "It was not a problem... as all of his castmates were in love with him, too."
msgstr ""

#: amir_mirror/amir_realize_friend_join/40
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "It speaks to the genuine generosity of Amir's heart that even with all this love running around the set, there was not a single incidence of jealousy. There were no broken hearts."
msgstr ""

#: amir_mirror/amir_realize_friend_join/48
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "In fact, The Soft and the Sensual became even more famous with other actors and potential crewmembers than it was with its massive, adoring public..."
msgstr ""

#: amir_mirror/amir_realize_friend_join/56
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "...everyone wanted to work on a set where love truly did Reign."
msgstr ""

#: amir_mirror/amir_realize_friend_join/64
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "When it became clear that Amir was the source of this power, he was given his own spinoff show."
msgstr ""

#: amir_mirror/amir_realize_friend_join/72
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "\"Mehdi: Racing for Love\" has been nominated for awards every single year of its run."
msgstr ""

#: amir_mirror/amir_realize_friend_join/80
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "Alas... it has never won."
msgstr ""
